        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Animate images into video\"\nicon: \"movie\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add the ability for users to upload a photo and then generate a video using the `gemini-interactions-api` skill with model: gemini-omni-1.1-flash via the Interactions API. The generated video must have an aspect ratio of `16:9` (landscape) or `9:16` (portrait)."
        }
