    end_line: 73
    content: "# Gmail API\n\n## Scopes\n\n-   `https://mail.google.com/` \342\200\224 Read, compose, send, and permanently delete all\n    your email from Gmail.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.addons.current.action.compose` \342\200\224\n    Manage drafts and send emails when you interact with the add-on.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.addons.current.message.action` \342\200\224 View\n    your email messages when you interact with the add-on.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.addons.current.message.metadata` \342\200\224\n    View your email message metadata when the add-on is running.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.addons.current.message.readonly` \342\200\224\n    View your email messages when the add-on is running.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.compose` \342\200\224 Manage drafts and send\n    emails.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.insert` \342\200\224 Add emails into your Gmail\n    mailbox.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.labels` \342\200\224 See and edit your email\n    labels.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.metadata` \342\200\224 View your email message\n    metadata such as labels and headers, but not the email body.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.modify` \342\200\224 Read, compose, and send\n    emails from your Gmail account.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.readonly` \342\200\224 View your email messages\n    and settings.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.send` \342\200\224 Send email on your behalf.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.settings.basic` \342\200\224 See, edit, create,\n    or change your email settings and filters in Gmail.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.settings.sharing` \342\200\224 Manage your\n    sensitive mail settings, including who can manage your mail.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n-   **Messages**: Individual email messages.\n-   **Labels**: Used to organize messages (e.g., INBOX, TRASH, custom labels).\n-   **Threads**: Groups of related messages.\n-   **Drafts**: Messages that have been created but not sent.\n\n## Client-Side Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Example: List messages\nconst res = await fetch(\'https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages\', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n```\n\n## Server-Side Pattern (Next.js API Route)\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/gmail/route.ts\nexport async function GET(req: NextRequest) {\n  const token = req.headers.get(\'Authorization\');\n  const res = await fetch(\'https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages\', {\n    headers: { Authorization: token! },\n  });\n  return NextResponse.json(await res.json());\n}\n```\n"
    num_lines: 74
    num_bytes: 2544
    line_range_bytes: 2544
  }
}
