  view_file {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///skills/system_skills/workspace_integration/references/forms.md"
    end_line: 58
    content: "# Google Forms API\n\n## Scopes\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive` \342\200\224 See, edit, create, and delete all\n    of your Google Drive files.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file` \342\200\224 See, edit, create, and delete\n    only the specific Google Drive files you use with this app.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.readonly` \342\200\224 See and download all your\n    Google Drive files.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/forms.body` \342\200\224 See, edit, create, and delete\n    all your Google Forms forms.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/forms.body.readonly` \342\200\224 See all your Google\n    Forms forms.\n\n-   `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/forms.responses.readonly` \342\200\224 See all\n    responses to your Google Forms forms.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n-   **Forms**: The top-level resource representing a form.\n-   **Items**: Components of a form, such as questions, images, or sections.\n-   **Questions**: Specific fields within items that collect data.\n-   **Responses**: Submissions from users who filled out the form.\n\n## Client-Side Pattern\n\nAlways sanitize and URL-encode `formId` (for example with `encodeURIComponent`)\nbefore interpolating it into the request URL.\n\n```typescript\n// Get form\nconst safeFormId = encodeURIComponent(formId.trim());\nconst res = await fetch(`https://forms.googleapis.com/v1/forms/${safeFormId}`, {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\nconst data = await res.json();\n```\n\n## Server-Side Pattern (Next.js API Route)\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/forms/route.ts\nexport async function GET(req: NextRequest) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(req.url);\n  const formId = searchParams.get(\'formId\') ?? \'\';\n  const safeFormId = encodeURIComponent(formId.trim());\n  const token = req.headers.get(\'Authorization\');\n  const res = await fetch(`https://forms.googleapis.com/v1/forms/${safeFormId}`, {\n    headers: { Authorization: token! },\n  });\n  return NextResponse.json(await res.json());\n}\n```\n"
    num_lines: 59
    num_bytes: 1945
    line_range_bytes: 1945
  }
}
