  planner_response {
    response: "Review the cards below to connect **Google Drive, Google Sheets, Gmail, Google Calendar, Google Docs, Google Slides, Google Tasks, Google Chat, and Google Forms** and select your paid Gemini API key for **Pretty Charm**:\n\n- **Google Drive, Google Sheets, Google Docs, and Google Slides**: Access, organize, read, and update store files, financial reports, catalogue spreadsheets, policy documents, and presentation decks, with permission from the app\'s users.\n- **Gmail and Google Chat**: Read and send customer support emails, order updates, and team space messages, with permission from the app\'s users.\n- **Google Calendar, Google Tasks, and Google Forms**: View and manage dispatch schedules, fulfilment tasks, and customer feedback form responses, with permission from the app\'s users.\n- **Gemini Creative & Intelligence Models**: Enable high-resolution product image generation (`1K`, `2K`, `4K`), image editing, video generation (`16:9` and `9:16`), and smart store assistant features.\n\nOnce you confirm these cards, I will immediately proceed through all 12 implementation phases to build, test, and verify the complete **Pretty Charm** e-commerce platform and admin suite."
