  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Frontend Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on constructing modular frontend components in `/src/components/`. Currently, I\'m implementing `/src/components/PWAInstallBanner.tsx`. This utilizes the `usePWAInstall` and `useOnlineStatus` hooks from the `pwa-integration` skill. I am ensuring that the \"Install App\" button is accessible for users.\n\n\n**Adding Navigation Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial features for user experience. I\'ve started with the top navigation, including the account menu. My focus then shifted to the iOS installation modal and a clear offline indicator banner. I\'m prioritizing accessibility and intuitive design within the top navigation elements, to make sure this meets the users needs.\n\n\n**Designing Control Dock Interface**\n\nI\'m now deep in the design phase for the collapsible bottom control dock. I\'m focusing on implementing finish swatches (Blush Rose, Champagne Cream, Velvet Burgundy), an exploded-view slider, and camera presets (Front Studio, Top Flatlay, Jewellery Macro). I\'m also considering the best way to implement the \"hide controls\" / \"show controls\" toggle. I need to make sure that the dock is sleek and that the toggle is intuitive.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_332516"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Download, WifiOff, X } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface BeforeInstallPromptEvent extends Event {\\n  prompt: () => Promise<void>;\\n  userChoice: Promise<{ outcome: \'accepted\' | \'dismissed\'; platform: string }>;\\n}\\n\\nexport function usePWAInstall() {\\n  const [deferredPrompt, setDeferredPrompt] = useState<BeforeInstallPromptEvent | null>(null);\\n  const [isInstalled, setIsInstalled] = useState(false);\\n  const [isIOS, setIsIOS] = useState(false);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const isStandalone =\\n      window.matchMedia(\'(display-mode: standalone)\').matches ||\\n      (window.navigator as unknown as { standalone?: boolean }).standalone === true;\\n    setIsInstalled(isStandalone);\\n\\n    const ua = window.navigator.userAgent.toLowerCase();\\n    setIsIOS(/iphone|ipad|ipod/.test(ua));\\n\\n    const handleBeforeInstallPrompt = (e: Event) => {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      setDeferredPrompt(e as BeforeInstallPromptEvent);\\n    };\\n\\n    const handleAppInstalled = () => {\\n      setIsInstalled(true);\\n      setDeferredPrompt(null);\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'beforeinstallprompt\', handleBeforeInstallPrompt);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'appinstalled\', handleAppInstalled);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'beforeinstallprompt\', handleBeforeInstallPrompt);\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'appinstalled\', handleAppInstalled);\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const install = async () => {\\n    if (!deferredPrompt) return false;\\n    await deferredPrompt.prompt();\\n    const { outcome } = await deferredPrompt.userChoice;\\n    if (outcome === \'accepted\') {\\n      setIsInstalled(true);\\n      setDeferredPrompt(null);\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n    return false;\\n  };\\n\\n  return {\\n    isInstallable: Boolean(deferredPrompt),\\n    isInstalled,\\n    isIOS,\\n    install,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function useOnlineStatus() {\\n  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(\\n    typeof navigator !== \'undefined\' ? navigator.onLine : true\\n  );\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onOnline = () => setIsOnline(true);\\n    const onOffline = () => setIsOnline(false);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'online\', onOnline);\\n    window.addEventListener(\'offline\', onOffline);\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'online\', onOnline);\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'offline\', onOffline);\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  return isOnline;\\n}\\n\\nexport const PWAInstallButton: React.FC = () => {\\n  const { isInstallable, isInstalled, isIOS, install } = usePWAInstall();\\n  const [showModal, setShowModal] = useState(false);\\n\\n  if (isInstalled) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      <button\\n        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n        onClick={() => {\\n          if (isInstallable) {\\n            install();\\n          } else {\\n            setShowModal(true);\\n          }\\n        }}\\n        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[#e4b7c0] bg-[#fff8fa] text-xs font-medium text-[#7a3b47] hover:bg-[#fce9ee] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Install Pretty Charm App\\\"\\n      >\\n        <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n        <span>Install App</span>\\n      </button>\\n\\n      {showModal && (\\n        <div\\n          className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/50 p-4\\\"\\n          role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n          aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n          aria-labelledby=\\\"pwa-install-title\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-sm rounded-2xl bg-[#fffdfb] border border-[#e4b7c0] p-6 shadow-xl\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\\\">\\n              <h3 id=\\\"pwa-install-title\\\" className=\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#2d1e22]\\\">\\n                Install Pretty Charm App\\n              </h3>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setShowModal(false)}\\n                className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-[#7a3b47] hover:bg-[#fce9ee]\\\"\\n                aria-label=\\\"Close install guide\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n            {isIOS ? (\\n              <p className=\\\"text-sm text-[#5c4349] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                1. Tap the <strong>Share</strong> icon in your Safari toolbar.<br />\\n                2. Scroll down and select <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong> for instant 1-tap access to Pretty Charm.\\n              </p>\\n            ) : (\\n              <p className=\\\"text-sm text-[#5c4349] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                Use your browser menu (<strong>\342\213\256</strong> or address bar icon) and select <strong>Install Pretty Charm</strong> or <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong> to install the standalone web app.\\n              </p>\\n            )}\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setShowModal(false)}\\n              className=\\\"mt-5 w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#9e5461] text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#83424e] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              Got It\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\nexport const OfflineIndicator: React.FC = () => {\\n  const isOnline = useOnlineStatus();\\n  if (isOnline) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      role=\\\"status\\\"\\n      className=\\\"fixed bottom-20 left-4 z-50 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#7a3b47] px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white shadow-lg\\\"\\n    >\\n      <WifiOff className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n      <span>Offline Mode \342\200\224 Viewing cached store catalogue.</span>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create PWAInstallButton and OfflineIndicator components following pwa-integration guidelines\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/PWAInstallBanner.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating PWAInstallBanner.tsx component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/PWAInstallBanner.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\314\032\n\311\032\001i\024}\023\222Y\003\310\306=9\037\v2\f\000k\351f\201\230C\253\233t\032$L\"e\264h\207\257\314\216\222SNLM\270\245\f*\255\030M::\230\363_\006\337]@\246p_\307^\341.\350\n\177\003\'\347\031\302.\211\353\273\023[PpL\224\300X\241\220\327\334\323\350\225J\204\355\034J\211\366\033~5&\326]H\3550\260\026\341\203:\305\v=\327Y(E\232\335f/\363r{.\267\205\305E\241\222\244\233l&s\235\261\234I\260\360\243\337u {\025\020\305\256\216\341\270\217m\311bU\243D\020\224\a\342\354Ph\004J\365\272\356%\025?\227\177\213t B\'\246K\327\271\211\264\231\'\322\302*~~\354\332*}\256\217k\256\202\207\263\223\\U\236\352\372\200{su\342L0\375\313\334$\031\317\251\312KZ\221\000EH:R\320T1T\321c\314\225iW\320\374ZU\026\376\025\265pd\307H}(\241C\354\312\225\3459M\t\030\334\303\205\003\2248\265\005\325\362\227\rW}P8\352o\036\345\213\242n\3646\212(\201\325@\355\300k\345\273\372+\36540z|\302,p\335\3773\037E\3511\\\247\212m\321\226\016m\036\033%\016\363o\016I\370A#\335\215*q\036\351gfb\221\257\211\273\022\341\363q\367\271[p+\227\n\266\325f\203a\370\220\237\307,mU\b\027\336\332\254\246\303\373\360\224\367\327I\250A?\374Q1*Nx\300\232\256\331\f\322\237\005\351?\341+\353f\273\257^~\331p7:\240\177\206\032c\207\233j\370LF\022\316ZK\330)\357\030kD\315n\311|\026\317\221\273E\220w\344\206\342\2438QuR\240)\"\"\343C\352>_\351\'N\367\000\343Y\220\025\262\241\207\"!m\206\207\005O\355\2434\247T\2667\341\330\365E\305,\025\241\256\221`\341\345\203\324\026\352\023\244\300\350l\033t^0~/%\3379*\271He\363\256M\227\003\225;\330?\032z\227S\326\210I\333O\030\214\321\316>H\r\"\021\372\305\032\344]\303\2210\373\204\005\323\234\314\3178\345/,\273\361\"\226I&/V0^\311\3645\034\353I\277q\375\023r48\210\304\322<\376z(\322A\0249\304i]Q\323\257\231\230\362\004\256\000\325\005[\262\267\352!\"\203>\037?\221\f\361(R\005\001\246p\2415\277\312\233X\241\314\315\277:\311\212\a\315d\272\254P\312\206W\242!\033\370\"m\323\2326Rb\222m\2459#\376\006`\200K`\353\216\213>M\220\221\016\231\360e \275\346\27