    combined_output {
      full: "### Browser `default` opened with pid 350.### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.goto(\'http://localhost:3000?autostart=1\');```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1- Page Title: Pretty Charm \342\200\223 Gift Hampers, Jewellery & Hair Accessories### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-10-24T04-53-42-248Z.yml)### Events- New console entries: .playwright-cli/console-2026-10-24T04-53-40-929Z.log#L1### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.setViewportSize({ width: 1440, height: 900 });```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait (async page => { await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\"hero-shop-btn\"]\', { timeout: 10000 }); })(page);```### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](../../tmp/pc-desktop-home.png)### Ran Playwright code```js// Screenshot viewport and save it as ../../tmp/pc-desktop-home.pngawait page.screenshot({  path: \'../../tmp/pc-desktop-home.png\',  scale: \'css\',  type: \'png\'});```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait (async page => {  // Verify draft hamper button text  const draftText = await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\"non-purchasable-\"]\').first().textContent();  console.log(\'Draft button text:\', draftText?.trim());  // Add first active product to cart  await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\"add-to-cart-\"]\').first().click();  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"header-cart-btn\"]\').click();  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\"proceed-to-checkout-btn\"]\');  const totalText = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"cart-grand-total\"]\').textContent();  console.log(\'Cart grand total:\', totalText?.trim());  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"proceed-to-checkout-btn\"]\').click();  await page.fill(\'input[name=\"fullName\"]\', \'Ananya Sharma\');  await page.fill(\'input[name=\"mobile\"]\', \'9876543210\');  await page.fill(\'input[name=\"houseFlat\"]\', \'Flat 402, DLF Phase 4\');  await page.fill(\'input[name=\"streetLocality\"]\', \'Sector 28, Galleria Road\');  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"place-order-submit-btn\"]\').click();  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\"confirmed-order-number\"]\');  const orderNum = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"confirmed-order-number\"]\').textContent();  console.log(\'Confirmed Order Number:\', orderNum?.trim());  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"track-this-order-btn\"]\').click();  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"track-order-submit-btn\"]\').click();  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\"tracked-order-eta\"]\');  const etaText = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"tracked-order-eta\"]\').textContent();  console.log(\'Tracked Order ETA:\', etaText?.trim());})(page);```### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](../../tmp/pc-order-tracked.png)### Ran Playwright code```js// Screenshot viewport and save it as ../../tmp/pc-order-tracked.pngawait page.screenshot({  path: \'../../tmp/pc-order-tracked.png\',  scale: \'css\',  type: \'png\'});```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait (async page => {  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\"open-admin-btn\"]\').click();  await page.waitForTimeout(600);})(page);```### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](../../tmp/pc-admin.png)### Ran Playwright code```js// Screenshot viewport and save it as ../../tmp/pc-admin.pngawait page.screenshot({  path: \'../../tmp/pc-admin.png\',  scale: \'css\',  type: \'png\'});```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.setViewportSize({ width: 390, height: 844 });```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.goto(\'http://localhost:3000?autostart=1\');```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1- Page Title: Pretty Charm \342\200\223 Gift Hampers, Jewellery & Hair Accessories### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-10-24T04-53-53-350Z.yml)### Events- New console entries: .playwright-cli/console-2026-10-24T04-53-52-755Z.log#L1### Ran Playwright code```jsawait (async page => { await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\"hero-shop-btn\"]\'); })(page);```### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](../../tmp/pc-mobile.png)### Ran Playwright code`