  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile UI Issues**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the mobile screenshot and the header\'s text wrapping. \"Pretty Charm\" and \"GURUGRAM STUDIO\" currently spill over the header on smaller screens due to the action cluster\'s elements taking up space. It\342\200\231s definitely something that requires a fix in the mobile view, given that we would not like for the content to overflow the header.\n\n\n**Implementing Mobile UI Fixes**\n\nI\'ve decided to implement a fix for the mobile header\'s text overflow immediately, following Phase 4. My plan includes making the brand logo non-wrapping, hiding redundant icons, and compacting the PWAInstallButton. To ensure a clean test environment, I\'ll reset the test order data in the database. I\'m aiming to achieve this through CSS and data operations. After the implementation, I plan to verify the mobile header again.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_347694"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Prevent mobile header logo wrapping and declutter mobile top bar actions\", \"EndLine\":625, \"Instruction\":\"Add whitespace-nowrap to brand logo and hide duplicate mobile icons already present in bottom nav\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"          {/* Brand Logo */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n            {screen !== \'home\' && (\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setScreen(\'home\')}\\n                aria-label=\\\"Back to Home\\\"\\n                className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#7c5c63]\\\"\\n              >\\n                <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'home\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left group focus:outline-none whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"font-serif text-xl sm:text-[26px] font-semibold text-[#2d1e21] tracking-tight block leading-none whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                Pretty Charm\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#9e5461] block mt-0.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                Gurugram Studio\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Primary Desktop Navigation Links (4 top-level items) */}\\n          <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-[#5c3d42]\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setSelectedCategorySlug(\'all\');\\n                setScreen(\'shop\');\\n              }}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'shop\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Shop Collection\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'categories\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'categories\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Categories\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'3d-studio\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'3d-studio\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <Box className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#9e5461]\\\" />\\n              <span>3D Hamper Studio</span>\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'track-order\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'track-order\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Track My Order\\n            </button>\\n          </nav>\\n\\n          {/* Right Action Cluster */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <PWAInstallButton />\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setIsAiModalOpen(true)}\\n              className=\\\"px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#fdf2f4] hover:bg-[#f8e1e6] text-[#9e5461] border border-[#f0d5da] text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Pretty Charm AI Styling Concierge\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">AI Stylist</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'wishlist\')}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Wishlist\\\"\\n              className=\\\"relative p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Heart className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              {wishlist.length > 0 && (\\n                <span className=\\\"absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#9e5461] text-white text-[10px] font-tabular flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                  {wishlist.length}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'cart\')}\\n              data-testid=\\\"header-cart-btn\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Shopping Bag\\\"\\n              className=\\\"relative p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ShoppingBag className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              {hydratedCart.length > 0 && (\\n                <span\\n                  data-testid=\\\"cart-badge-count\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#9e5461] text-white text-[10px] font-tabular flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {hydratedCart.reduce((s, i) => s + i.quantity, 0)}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(customerUser ? \'account\' : \'auth\')}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Account\\\"\\n              className=\\\"hidden sm:inline-flex p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <User className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'admin\')}\\n              data-testid=\\\"open-admin-btn\\\"\\n              className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-[#f0d5da] text-[11px] font-medium text-[#7c5c63] hover:text-[#9e5461] hover:border-[#9e5461] whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              Admin\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\", \"StartLine\":515, \"TargetContent\":\"          {/* Brand Logo */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            {screen !== \'home\' && (\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setScreen(\'home\')}\\n                aria-label=\\\"Back to Home\\\"\\n                className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#7c5c63]\\\"\\n              >\\n                <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'home\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left group focus:outline-none\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-[26px] font-semibold text-[#2d1e21] tracking-tight block leading-none\\\">\\n                Pretty Charm\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9e5461] block mt-0.5\\\">\\n                Gurugram Studio\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Primary Desktop Navigation Links (4 top-level items) */}\\n          <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-[#5c3d42]\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setSelectedCategorySlug(\'all\');\\n                setScreen(\'shop\');\\n              }}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'shop\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Shop Collection\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'categories\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'categories\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Categories\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'3d-studio\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'3d-studio\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <Box className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#9e5461]\\\" />\\n              <span>3D Hamper Studio</span>\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'track-order\')}\\n              className={`hover:text-[#9e5461] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                screen === \'track-order\' ? \'text-[#9e5461] font-semibold\' : \'\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Track My Order\\n            </button>\\n          </nav>\\n\\n          {/* Right Action Cluster */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\\\">\\n            <PWAInstallButton />\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setIsAiModalOpen(true)}\\n              className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#fdf2f4] hover:bg-[#f8e1e6] text-[#9e5461] border border-[#f0d5da] text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Pretty Charm AI Styling Concierge\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">AI Stylist</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'wishlist\')}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Wishlist\\\"\\n              className=\\\"relative p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Heart className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              {wishlist.length > 0 && (\\n                <span className=\\\"absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#9e5461] text-white text-[10px] font-tabular flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                  {wishlist.length}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'cart\')}\\n              data-testid=\\\"header-cart-btn\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Shopping Bag\\\"\\n              className=\\\"relative p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ShoppingBag className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              {hydratedCart.length > 0 && (\\n                <span\\n                  data-testid=\\\"cart-badge-count\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"absolute -top-0.5 -right-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#9e5461] text-white text-[10px] font-tabular flex items-center justify-center\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {hydratedCart.reduce((s, i) => s + i.quantity, 0)}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(customerUser ? \'account\' : \'auth\')}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Account\\\"\\n              className=\\\"p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#fdf2f4] text-[#5c3d42] transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <User className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setScreen(\'admin\')}\\n              data-testid=\\\"open-admin-btn\\\"\\n              className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-[#f0d5da] text-[11px] font-medium text-[#7c5c63] hover:text-[#9e5461] hover:border-[#9e5461] whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              Admin\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Fixing mobile header logo wrapping in src/App.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix mobile header in src/App.tsx\"}"
