            lines {
              text: "      \'All orders are packed and dispatched from our studio in Gurugram, Haryana (PIN 122001). Shipping across India is \342\202\27159 for orders below \342\202\271499, \342\202\27139 for orders from \342\202\271499 to \342\202\271998, and FREE on orders \342\202\271999 and above.\'"
