            lines {
              text: "      \'In accordance with Pretty Charm transparency rules, draft hampers (Mini Hamper, Bestie Box, Premium Box, Celebration Box) display their proposed prices and cannot be purchased until the store owner confirms their exact contents, photography, and physical stock in the Admin Panel.\'"
