  planner_response {
    response: "The **Pretty Charm** e-commerce platform and 15-section Admin Suite are built, tested, and running.\n\n### Key Capabilities Implemented\n- **Customer Storefront (23 Screens & Mobile/Desktop Navigation)**:\n  - Includes the Brand Splash Screen, Sign-In/Registration, Home Page, Category Showcase, Product Listing & Filtering, Product Details with Variant Selection & Indian PIN-Code Serviceability Check (`122001` Gurugram origin), Wishlist, Shopping Bag, Guest/Account Checkout, Manual UPI Payment Reference Submission, Order Confirmation, Phone-Verified Order Tracking, 3D Keepsake Hamper & Accessory Studio, AI Styling Concierge, Customer Account/Order History/Saved Addresses, FAQ, Contact Us, About Us, and all 4 Legal/Policy screens.\n  - **Catalogue & Publication Safeguards**: Active Hair Accessories and Jewellery are ready to purchase with real stock reservation. The 4 initial Gift Hampers (*Mini Hamper \342\202\271299*, *Bestie Box \342\202\271299*, *Premium Box \342\202\271449*, *Celebration Box \342\202\271449*) are seeded as **Drafts** and locked from purchase until confirmed and published by an Administrator. *Cosmetics & Beauty* and *Festive Collection* are marked **Coming Soon** and cannot be purchased.\n- **Persistent SQLite Database & Transactional Backend**:\n  - Uses Node\'s native `node:sqlite` (`./data/pretty_charm.sqlite`) with WAL concurrency and `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` ACID transactions for atomic stock reservation, Weighted Average Cost (WAC) inventory valuation, goods receipts (GRN), and cancellation stock releases.\n  - Enforces server-side INR paise pricing and configurable shipping tiers (`< \342\202\271499 \342\206\222 \342\202\27159`, `\342\202\271499\342\200\223\342\202\271998 \342\206\222 \342\202\27139`, `\342\211\245 \342\202\271999 \342\206\222 Free`).\n- **15-Section Admin Panel & Excel/CSV Exports**:\n  - Protected by first-run Owner Bootstrap (`/api/admin/bootstrap`), PBKDF2-SHA512 password hashing, rate limiting, and audit logs.\n  - Covers Overview, Products, Categories, Inventory & Movements, Suppliers & Purchases, Orders & Fulfilment, Customers, Sales Analytics, Profit & COGS Calculator, Expenses, Shipping & PIN Codes, 10 `.xlsx`/`.csv` Business Report Exports, Shiprocket & WhatsApp Integrations, Store Settings, and Security Audit Logs."
    modified_response: "The **Pretty Charm** e-commerce platform and 15-section Admin Suite are built, tested, and running.\n\n### Key Capabilities Implemented\n- **Customer Storefront (23 Screens & Mobile/Desktop Navigation)**:\n  - Includes the Brand Splash Screen, Sign-In/Registration, Home Page, Category Showcase, Product Listing & Filtering, Product Details with Variant Selection & Indian PIN-Code Serviceability Check (`122001` Gurugram origin), Wishlist, Shopping Bag, Guest/Account Checkout, Manual UPI Payment Reference Submission, Order Confirmation, Phone-Verified Order Tracking, 3D Keepsake Hamper & Accessory Studio, AI Styling Concierge, Customer Account/Order History/Saved Addresses, FAQ, Contact Us, About Us, and all 4 Legal/Policy screens.\n  - **Catalogue & Publication Safeguards**: Active Hair Accessories and Jewellery are ready to purchase with real stock reservation. The 4 initial Gift Hampers (*Mini Hamper \342\202\271299*, *Bestie Box \342\202\271299*, *Premium Box \342\202\271449*, *Celebration Box \342\202\271449*) are seeded as **Drafts** and locked from purchase until confirmed and published by an Administrator. *Cosmetics & Beauty* and *Festive Collection* are marked **Coming Soon** and cannot be purchased.\n- **Persistent SQLite Database & Transactional Backend**:\n  - Uses Node\'s native `node:sqlite` (`./data/pretty_charm.sqlite`) with WAL concurrency and `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` ACID transactions for atomic stock reservation, Weighted Average Cost (WAC) inventory valuation, goods receipts (GRN), and cancellation stock releases.\n  - Enforces server-side INR paise pricing and configurable shipping tiers (`< \342\202\271499 \342\206\222 \342\202\27159`, `\342\202\271499\342\200\223\342\202\271998 \342\206\222 \342\202\27139`, `\342\211\245 \342\202\271999 \342\206\222 Free`).\n- **15-Section Admin Panel & Excel/CSV Exports**:\n  - Protected by first-run Owner Bootstrap (`/api/admin/bootstrap`), PBKDF2-SHA512 password hashing, rate limiting, and audit logs.\n  - Covers Overview, Products, Categories, Inventory & Movements, Suppliers & Purchases, Orders & Fulfilment, Customers, Sales Analytics, Profit & COGS Calculator, Expenses, Shipping & PIN Codes, 10 `.xlsx`/`.csv` Business Report Exports, Shiprocket & WhatsApp Integrations, Store Settings, and Security Audit Logs."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\247\004\n\244\004\001i\024}\023\b4\335\366\376\356pw\330\300\202\035\366\305\357\031ys\2074\341\330\022u1HHhr/\364\263vG[\022+\207\370\224f\331\222\216\353\230\324\202\344\2733\021\265\017\244\212\264\371\241\323\\\\.\360\350\323iw\276\021Z\201\247\311\330\236\340\232\026f\f\275n\240\0276Q=\027\3263\b\2516\266\264W\031\270@7\372\340\005\fGZ\361\'\266T\272Cb\314\350\006Z7\032\246\305D\345\375\261V{?\024\262V\0374|\243\275\354?\020\326{W\b\033R\3034\004\303\320\233\203\t\v\031\322\266v\020\023\t\v?*K<\v\254\"\247\326\f\245\031\213s\355\201\224)\263i#&k<KOi\030!\350\'\3535-[ap\224\206\016q\200\306\235}\023\306lgEzyr\344\207\206zv\202\035^\346u)\226\030me\204\343VB\036$\232\315\233Y\366:\203\2166\024\266\361\353\302r\351q\264\370<\037\016\276\2045\032\300\312\377\311\255\021\336m\3168\314\320\263\201 I\357I\003\273g\335\021\250\261\'\033\302\304\240\034\253\242\361\317n\'\326\360\315\261\177\333m\217k)\373\225h\232\020P\035\220\243\377*\315\201\261\"\020\001\203-\345\207F\'\231\0336\006\244\220\212\037\364\005\026@\210\277B\021^Q\330\026\032\a\351\257\217\375\342w\341pX#r\372\254\227\340\356\3034\203\271&\310\003\356\204d\265\325c\207w\234\205\036-\375\247s\356-L\020\361\347\201\221\003\201\b)\275\276\227#y\025E\343u\027r1\360D\345\372\364F\237%\205?\363a\225u\277kw\0058\203A>\212eN\264z\204\272\261\214\"C_x\216\264\263\306\240:V\354F\034\275\2765)B^\035\260\244\341n#Vk\233d\337)/\023- \251\353\020{\333W\3222\356\353\205>\203\035&d4\241\306F\331$\020\001\376#5x(\027\236,\377\367\1777T{\032\341Nf|\230\374\217\006C\254q9\362\214\264\322\273\363\325O"
