  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Relevance and Utility**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating two key aspects: `ultra-mode` and `computer-use`. I\'m determining their relevance and practical utility. `ultra-mode` necessitates rigorous logic unit testing, implementation, and browser verification via Playwright. Simultaneously, I\'m verifying the utility of `computer-use`. I need to ensure they align and function as expected.\n\n\n**Analyzing Sorting Implementation**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation details of the sorting feature. I\'m focusing on the frontend design aspect, specifically how the rendered sorting UI behaves in Chromium. The plan is to implement sorting functionality for the Category Page and Product Listing screens using clean UI controls, and how they interact. I\'m scrutinizing `src/App.tsx`, focusing on the pure sorting function and its decoupling, per `ultra-mode`, including unit tests. I am considering both `screen === \'shop\'` and `screen === \'categories\'` paths, and analyzing their behavior.\n\n\n"
