  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Product Sort Options**\n\nI\'ve just added `ProductSortOption`, `PRODUCT_SORT_OPTIONS` including \'Price: Low to High\', \'Price: High to Low\', \'Newest Arrivals\', and \'Featured\' to `src/shared/domainLogic.ts`. Along with this, `SortableProduct` and `sortCatalogueProducts` are now also in place.\n\n\n**Implementing Sort Feature Tests**\n\nI\'m now writing unit tests in `src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts` to cover the sorting functionality, specifically for the \'price-asc\', \'price-desc\', \'newest\', and \'featured\' options. These tests will also ensure the sorting doesn\'t mutate the original product data. I\'m also ensuring the `publicProducts` on the server now includes `createdAt` and `updatedAt` timestamps. These additions will facilitate the correct implementation of sort options.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_323437"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add ProductSortOption, PRODUCT_SORT_OPTIONS, and pure sortCatalogueProducts helper to src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"EndLine\":741, \"Instruction\":\"Add Section 10 for product listing and category page sorting logic\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  return `https://wa.me/${cleanPhone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`;\\n}\\n\\n// ============================================================================\\n// 10. PRODUCT LISTING & CATEGORY PAGE SORTING\\n// ============================================================================\\n\\nexport type ProductSortOption = \'featured\' | \'price-asc\' | \'price-desc\' | \'newest\';\\n\\nexport const PRODUCT_SORT_OPTIONS: ReadonlyArray<{\\n  value: ProductSortOption;\\n  label: string;\\n}> = [\\n  { value: \'featured\', label: \'Featured\' },\\n  { value: \'price-asc\', label: \'Price: Low to High\' },\\n  { value: \'price-desc\', label: \'Price: High to Low\' },\\n  { value: \'newest\', label: \'Newest Arrivals\' },\\n];\\n\\nexport interface SortableProduct {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  sellingPricePaise: number;\\n  status?: ProductStatus | string;\\n  featured?: boolean;\\n  createdAt?: string | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function sortCatalogueProducts<T extends SortableProduct>(\\n  products: readonly T[],\\n  sortBy: ProductSortOption\\n): T[] {\\n  const copy = [...products];\\n  copy.sort((a, b) => {\\n    if (sortBy === \'price-asc\') {\\n      const diff = a.sellingPricePaise - b.sellingPricePaise;\\n      if (diff !== 0) return diff;\\n      return a.name.localeCompare(b.name);\\n    }\\n\\n    if (sortBy === \'price-desc\') {\\n      const diff = b.sellingPricePaise - a.sellingPricePaise;\\n      if (diff !== 0) return diff;\\n      return a.name.localeCompare(b.name);\\n    }\\n\\n    if (sortBy === \'newest\') {\\n      const timeA = a.createdAt ? Date.parse(a.createdAt) : 0;\\n      const timeB = b.createdAt ? Date.parse(b.createdAt) : 0;\\n      const safeTimeA = Number.isFinite(timeA) ? timeA : 0;\\n      const safeTimeB = Number.isFinite(timeB) ? timeB : 0;\\n      if (safeTimeB !== safeTimeA) {\\n        return safeTimeB - safeTimeA;\\n      }\\n      return String(b.id).localeCompare(String(a.id));\\n    }\\n\\n    // Default \'featured\': active products first, then featured flag, then price ascending\\n    const aActive = a.status === \'active\' ? 1 : 0;\\n    const bActive = b.status === \'active\' ? 1 : 0;\\n    if (aActive !== bActive) return bActive - aActive;\\n\\n    const aFeatured = a.featured ? 1 : 0;\\n    const bFeatured = b.featured ? 1 : 0;\\n    if (aFeatured !== bFeatured) return bFeatured - aFeatured;\\n\\n    return a.sellingPricePaise - b.sellingPricePaise;\\n  });\\n  return copy;\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":738, \"TargetContent\":\"  return `https://wa.me/${cleanPhone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`;\\n}\\n\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding sortCatalogueProducts to src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add sortCatalogueProducts to domainLogic.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\202\016\n\377\r\001i\024}\023\332\265\350\347\016;\265^ur\376TR\236\263\215\005%\331a\205\023|\363\356lRT\336\223\'\351\305\317\240\232\020\221>1p{\221\310a`*<T\376\264U\216\345\254\244\232\374\336Xy\302\311\242\375*H$\243\032\303\003\376\031\330\253\v\"\200}\211\023\312\350e\251Ar\203\221\354n\323\016\362]\207x\260\027\201Md\3507p\325\324\227\376\025\351\360\303\237e\207|\217\020)\025v\n\001\213\031$]\355\260\371\000\374\354\266\371DS\312\311\247\201\270)\231\220\231<\\\037fk\024\343\337\'\264R\316\022\232\016/T\220N\022\211\314\362r\317\36453\325H\016\236\203\270#e2YOv/\027=!\005a-\022\222\231\214\216\265\345Hr\204\364\340\367_\027\300|\307y\337\235&\331B:\231\363\252\\]3j\025=\332\373`5\022\241\3468\257\325W\3579\206B\357|\2348\246\315X\004d\333\372\357\253p\355\220\377|;<\f\234\301\'\346\vx\314L\273\236\302\337\207\227\221\331|\262\251\203\332\034\350d\224\253\330y\335\352\375\205.\235:M\241\033\374\353\027\206Jw\033\365\351\251D\371,q\314\2116\003\312\223\355\204<\311n\316E\361Y#\233Q\224\v\b\360\353\224\242i\355\255\033\353\314\222\352\225}\236\335\372\324\026\266~\205\323\000\347\304\227\bo\236\217D\325\335f\330D\265\'\255\3606\"\3759<\341\373\335\t\177\257&\315P\035\\9\222\336%\002\260\005\260\323\256;m\031\355d\206\3761\305$dMA\215\356\234\0001\352\250,\200\227\370siS\024=\204\234\\\376\231D\235\203\355\361\027\2034\020\230%\024ho\236V\362\272\236\035\310\263pW\323<\272\263\005dA\352\2655\317NqU\aS\351\340\366\270U\315\236\202\231\256yuaq\313\242r\346BOzr\374!\273\351\224q\330\301\227\354E\034\335\205\370\311\233F\316\240\236\264\220f\224\271\026\021\260\360\023\337\332*\315\240yF\022\313\304\326\016\b&\375q\273\205\230\373\335\366\2416[nQ\3244\232\rq%\017,5\374fR\363\026P\3100\bx78\276Q\254\372;\274{\002\032\3524\205\275Hu\211\233\374\npM\353\351\017\242\325E\272\034\362=\033\270:/);\002\347}U\367M\270\315x\2676\225t}/\005\242\214S\004\f\002\030\004\024X\236\312o\343\365\375m\2459\204Sx\346\026\343\354\t8\213\244r\031\346\33