  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Sorting Feature**\n\nI\'m now running the Playwright browser verification to test the sorting feature in a live browser at the specified URL. Specifically, I\'m checking if sorting by \"Price: Low to High\" (price-asc) correctly orders cards from the lowest price, which is \342\202\271179, to the highest, with the goal to verify this feature for our shop page.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_554979"
