  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Skill Check**\n\nI\'m now diving into the \"ultra-mode\" skill check. My focus is on inspecting the existing project, identifying areas for decoupling pure logic with accompanying unit tests, and implementing the new feature cleanly. I\'ll need to do it without disrupting the existing system. Finally, I intend to verify functionality in headless Chromium.\n\n\n**Refining Resource Utilization**\n\nI\'m focusing now on the essential tools for verification and data retrieval: computer usage and the Gemini API. The context includes existing search tools and image APIs, ensuring I can verify functionality. I\'m carefully reading the user\'s instructions regarding the product list, emphasizing that I must use the existing data without making any changes. Currently I am focused on the precise 10 products\' details, via a read-only query.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_160254"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst { DatabaseSync } = require(\\\"node:sqlite\\\");\\nconst db = new DatabaseSync(\\\"./data/pretty_charm.sqlite\\\");\\nconst prods = db.prepare(\\\"SELECT id, name, slug, category_slug, sku, selling_price_paise, stock_qty, reserved_qty, status, images_json FROM products ORDER BY id ASC\\\").all();\\nconst vars = db.prepare(\\\"SELECT id, product_id, name, sku, price_delta_paise, stock_qty FROM product_variants ORDER BY id ASC\\\").all();\\nconsole.log(\\\"EXISTING PRODUCTS COUNT:\\\", prods.length);\\nfor (const p of prods) {\\n  const pVars = vars.filter(v => v.product_id === p.id);\\n  const imgs = JSON.parse(p.images_json || \\\"[]\\\");\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({\\n    id: p.id,\\n    name: p.name,\\n    category: p.category_slug,\\n    sku: p.sku,\\n    pricePaise: p.selling_price_paise,\\n    stockQty: p.stock_qty,\\n    status: p.status,\\n    imageCount: imgs.length,\\n    firstImagePrefix: imgs[0] ? imgs[0].slice(0, 32) : null,\\n    variants: pVars.map(v => ({ id: v.id, name: v.name, sku: v.sku }))\\n  }));\\n}\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":5000, \"toolAction\":\"Inspecting existing products in SQLite database\", \"toolSummary\":\"Inspect existing products in SQLite\"}"
