    summary: "The specific product codes and names (**\"Pretty Charm\"**, **\"PC-HAIR-CLAW-01\"**, **\"PC-JWL-EAR-01\"**, or **\"Pretty Charm Mini Hamper\"**) typically point to curated women\'s accessories, jewelry sets, and gift hampers (similar collections like mini hair claw clips, heart necklaces, and floral/enamel stud earrings are frequently retailed under various lifestyle and gifting brands[1]). \n\nIf you are trying to source, purchase, or locate these specific items or a distributor handling the \"Pretty Charm\" line in **Gurugram**, here is how you can find them:\n\n1. **Online Gifting & Accessory Platforms:** Many brands supplying miniature claw clip hampers and jewelry sets operate primarily through e-commerce storefronts, quick-commerce infrastructure, or direct-to-consumer (D2C) websites that ship directly to Gurugram within 3 to 6 days.\n2. **Local Corporate & Festive Gifting Vendors:** Gurugram has a vast network of corporate gifting and custom hamper suppliers (frequently found across areas like DLF, Udyog Vihar, and Sector 29) that assemble custom miniature accessory boxes containing hair claws and earrings. \n3. **Wholesale & Manufacturing Hubs:** For bulk inquiries of SKU-based hair and jewelry charms, local wholesale networks spanning nearby major NCR trading hubs (such as Sadar Bazar in Delhi or localized suppliers listed via B2B directories like IndiaMART or Justdial) handle specific item codes.\n\nIf you are looking for a specific local store address, website link, or stock status in Gurugram, please provide additional context (such as the specific online marketplace or brand portal where you spotted these codes).\n\nSources:\n[1] [soleandbloom.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTZD3XA39Hw_6AbBSS58Mx8nplwXj3WyUgerijqitbVEiqIjHLzrCU1VaBPDuceLPGmrvTjRsbdCSG3TO0-6X30SqDCBURgtynDvH7BTuVjSrzNvYskboA11zO_qh9a1CV1b3M0AprPjjaqco9nDdT7JFsStnJS0RrE91Ef1E=)"
