    summary: "It looks like you are searching for a collection of trendy, feminine hair accessories\342\200\224potentially putting together a gift set, an outfit theme, or curating items from a boutique brand like \"Pretty Charm.\" \n\nHere is a breakdown of the stylish hair accessories you searched for:\n\n*   **Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw:** A metallic or acrylic claw clip featuring a warm, blush-toned rose gold finish accented with lustrous faux pearls[1][2]. It\342\200\231s a popular choice for romantic half-up styles, weddings, or elevating an everyday updo[1][2].\n*   **Mulberry Silk Scrunchie Trio:** A set of three hair ties crafted from high-grade mulberry silk (often 22-momme)[3][4]. Silk scrunchies are heavily favored for hair care because they glide smoothly to prevent friction, breakage, and creases (the \"no-crease\" effect)[3][4]. \n*   **Blush Satin Pearl Bow Barrette:** A soft, romantic hair bow made from smooth blush pink satin and decorated with delicate faux pearls[5]. These statement bows are trending heavily for both casual wear and special occasions like bridal showers, parties, or photo shoots[5].\n\nIf you are looking for where to buy a specific bundle, searching for these exact titles on marketplace platforms like Etsy, boutique hair accessory sites, or specialty gift shops will help you find matching sets. Let me know if you need styling advice or direct gift-matching ideas!\n\nSources:\n[1] [etsy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJSx04R4tA12Jq3h-psH6ydYypX0wJVZOE85asHgJEsPrjkf-Co3mefdCb9ZAGrA6alsWqGQyaOtKZ2qxCZARBk-15FeQhx-sJWvi8WSuu8X2rn4Wckzna2JurCbrHMO6dPRtK-w==)\n[2] [queenmee.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEhauxiKJHbKRZrFTavFBnz-hByAD2lZcSNga9Vtg35fX8eFjyk3xPm1N8RoU3zzqXNAn_99KH64RRlCTkhRUNxv9pemrx6amsAJwgnPaOWhayOYDgvlidmAADtE2SHE4g48MsdWzMI33QeHQ==)\n[3] [savvyinteal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKZSGIHwbS3DmeoCeoI81l0AlITkgXS9Figm9pYNX8S1Jq7YBK4oiJFKqK0OZ6SWVcVnr3CBkCnBNkjB61FyDcUMTXhdiI2Fz2quVWY8e8jWC4mCKTITYPQbBIJLMf6t1EkwEgRJ8aOU6lStopqBSQxDLU)\n[4] [houseofwhitemulberry.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEWoUqvU5nzKptpHptQi1ILDQkB9xouZSjHGG7bzNB6Iti-UlD7j7TWAASLPHI7ywvZgL_xY-ThxC2-ILbVdjbKcGO5JJ2EXa0lH0Su6RMrtMtGNkQnJUPkzsawups-RfBFwi34zTepBnms_7dIFReHtLYO6VNfJYc0-ynF054wVUYBAH9nFqDygLVez7eVnsOY0pA6LfepeQNE4-1ZJ-Oa1FeB-iKgaCoIe5CLu_JuFEdSjsav8Y0iKNyIarlnvXNgZ90d4ZRWWfWgDB5NE-Kh7ZkI4nL4UIM0kHj9m_Eb5xFPjIPQ0chjd-iGpuGr3l0cmuDiAx0ffg==)\n[5] [jewelrybyshinestar.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVSO1p_O8fm1p890sL5VUyZYGH2AHGyHm9YNDxro7ZkMmdJl_qJGMbo61em8GGf_bDG_OyRhCohbSwRDgNSUfKTuxdY6SNtIdF6VWsWZ6g-r8FbcAtS3rvgN1FxFaqMeCQZkMN3soUYtli0NfLeJ_GSSMgrLXHKkpUPTk7M76CsHooO3TOdLgK6En1tTm3PVIN7Gb2COVe-Tw32aXlRn4no5iSHrNbfk1JgWA71U0FDPI3pz2oq3WPhDVQkHuE-ZcPO-OQIUmbT0E5dNju2vtheJ1Fq74=)"
