  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Search Results**\n\nI\'m currently examining the completeness and accuracy of search results across our ten products, specifically focusing on the initial three hair accessories: Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw, Mulberry Silk Scrunchie Trio, and a third (unspecified) item. My primary goal is to ensure that the information presented to users is comprehensive and reliable for each search query related to these products.\n\n\n**Verifying Third-Party Sources**\n\nI\'ve just finished investigating listings for the Blush Satin Pearl Bow Barrette (`PC-HAIR-BOW-02`). While web searches uncovered similar items on various boutiques like Queenmee and Etsy, their images are unusable due to unverified commercial reuse rights. So, these external sources are noted, but I\'m keeping the original audit status and unchanged images.\n\n\n**Confirming Product Sources**\n\nI\'ve just concluded researching the `Pretty Charm Celebration Box` and its mini hamper variant. My web searches validated the absence of external manufacturer listings for these Gurugram-designed gift boxes. This confirms the bespoke nature of these items, as soleandbloom.in sells different hampers. Since no reusable images exist, I\'m maintaining the original \"Image Needed\" status for them.\n\nI then moved on to the three jewelry items. The web search also confirmed the lack of any external, verified listings for the precise SKUs of the earrings, bracelet, and necklace. Therefore, their image status remains unchanged, awaiting original studio photography.\n\n\n**Implementing Admin View**\n\nI\'m now focused on enabling the Admin to directly access the \"Step 4: Admin Image Report\" within the Admin Suite. I\'m planning a dedicated section for \"Original Photo Audit & Approval\" within the Admin Products tab, along with a top-level \"Photo Audit Report\" tab. This involves creating summary KPI cards for the five audit statuses, integrating a \"Catalogue Integrity Verification Banner,\" and displaying detailed information (Product Name, ID, etc.) for each of the ten existing products. I\'ll need to include a \"Search Permitted Sources\" button that links to the appropriate API endpoint.\n\n\n**Designing Image Validation**\n\nI\'m now outlining the image validation workflow. I\'m building an API endpoint (`GET /api/admin/product-images/search/:productId`) to query the Wikimedia Commons API, validating candidate metadata. Then, I\'m designing a \"Submit Authorized Original Photo\" form where the admin can provide a URL or upload a file. The server will validate the image before setting the status. Finally, I\'m integrating \"Approve & Update\" and \"Reject Candidate\" buttons, giving the Admin control over image replacement and setting the primary image.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_180423"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add product_image_audits table and seed initial audit records and integrity baseline for the 10 existing products in src/server/db.ts\", \"Instruction\":\"Create product_image_audits table in initializeDatabase and seed audit records in seedInitialDataIfNeeded\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":316, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS store_settings (\\n      key TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\\n      value_json TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS product_image_audits (\\n      product_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\\n      brand TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'Pretty Charm\',\\n      search_query TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      audit_status TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'Original image found \342\200\224 awaiting approval\' | \'Image successfully added\' | \'Image Needed\' | \'Source or reuse permission unverified\' | \'Search failed\'\\n      candidate_image_url TEXT,\\n      source_url TEXT,\\n      license_info TEXT,\\n      reason TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      preserve_existing INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\\n      set_as_primary INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\\n      approved_by_email TEXT,\\n      approved_at TEXT,\\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      FOREIGN KEY (product_id) REFERENCES products(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\\n    );\\n  `);\\n\\n  seedInitialDataIfNeeded();\", \"StartLine\":309, \"TargetContent\":\"    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS store_settings (\\n      key TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\\n      value_json TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL\\n    );\\n  `);\\n\\n  seedInitialDataIfNeeded();\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":839, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO admin_users (id, email, full_name, role, password_hash, password_salt, is_active, created_at)\\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, \'owner\', ?, ?, 1, ?)\\n    `).run(\\n      \'admin-owner-1\',\\n      process.env.ADMIN_INITIAL_EMAIL.trim().toLowerCase(),\\n      \'Pretty Charm Owner\',\\n      hash,\\n      salt,\\n      now\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  // 7. Seed Initial Product Image Audit Records & Baseline Integrity Snapshot for the 10 Existing Products\\n  const existingAudits = db.prepare(\'SELECT COUNT(*) as c FROM product_image_audits\').get() as { c: number };\\n  if (existingAudits.c === 0) {\\n    const insertAudit = db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO product_image_audits (\\n        product_id, brand, search_query, audit_status, candidate_image_url, source_url, license_info, reason, preserve_existing, set_as_primary, updated_at\\n      ) VALUES (?, \'Pretty Charm\', ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 1, 1, ?)\\n    `);\\n\\n    const initialAudits: Array<{\\n      productId: string;\\n      query: string;\\n      status: string;\\n      candidateUrl: string | null;\\n      sourceUrl: string | null;\\n      license: string | null;\\n      reason: string;\\n    }> = [\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-mini-hamper\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Pretty Charm Mini Hamper\\\" \\\"PC-HMP-MINI\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Proprietary Pretty Charm Studio SKU\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Bespoke Pretty Charm draft gift hamper (SKU PC-HMP-MINI). No external manufacturer listing matches exact box contents; awaiting owner studio photograph.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-bestie-box\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Pretty Charm Bestie Box\\\" \\\"PC-HMP-BESTIE\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Proprietary Pretty Charm Studio SKU\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Bespoke Pretty Charm draft gift hamper (SKU PC-HMP-BESTIE). No external manufacturer listing matches exact box contents; awaiting owner studio photograph.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-premium-box\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Pretty Charm Premium Box\\\" \\\"PC-HMP-PREM\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Proprietary Pretty Charm Studio SKU\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Bespoke Pretty Charm draft gift hamper (SKU PC-HMP-PREM). No external manufacturer listing matches exact box contents; awaiting owner studio photograph.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-celebration-box\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Pretty Charm Celebration Box\\\" \\\"PC-HMP-CELEB\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Proprietary Pretty Charm Studio SKU\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Bespoke Pretty Charm draft gift hamper (SKU PC-HMP-CELEB). No external manufacturer listing matches exact box contents; awaiting owner studio photograph.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-pearl-claw\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw\\\" \\\"PC-HAIR-CLAW-01\\\" \\\"Classic Pearl (11 cm)\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Source or reuse permission unverified\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: \'https://queenmee.com\',\\n        license: \'Third-party retailer copyright \342\200\224 commercial reuse permission unverified\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Similar rose-gold pearl claw clips found on third-party boutiques (queenmee.com, etsy.com), but they are not verified manufacturer photos for SKU PC-HAIR-CLAW-01 and lack commercial reuse rights. Current image preserved; Image Needed from authorized supplier or studio.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-silk-scrunchie-trio\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Mulberry Silk Scrunchie Trio\\\" \\\"PC-HAIR-SCR-03\\\" \\\"Blush & Cream Trio\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Source or reuse permission unverified\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: \'https://houseofwhitemulberry.com\',\\n        license: \'Third-party retailer copyright \342\200\224 commercial reuse permission unverified\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Similar mulberry silk scrunchies found on houseofwhitemulberry.com and savvyinteal.com, but commercial reuse permission is unverified and packaging differs from SKU PC-HAIR-SCR-03. Current image preserved; Image Needed from authorized source.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-satin-bow-barrette\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Blush Satin Pearl Bow Barrette\\\" \\\"PC-HAIR-BOW-02\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Source or reuse permission unverified\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: \'https://jewelrybyshinestar.com\',\\n        license: \'Third-party retailer copyright \342\200\224 commercial reuse permission unverified\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'Similar blush satin pearl bow barrettes found on jewelrybyshinestar.com, but commercial image reuse is not permitted and exact SKU PC-HAIR-BOW-02 match is unverified. Current image preserved; Image Needed.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-pearl-drop-huggies\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Rose Gold Pearl Drop Huggies\\\" \\\"PC-JWL-EAR-01\\\" \\\"18k Rose Gold Finish\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Awaiting authorized supplier or studio photo\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'No exact official manufacturer or authorized distributor photograph with verified reuse permission found for SKU PC-JWL-EAR-01. Current image preserved unchanged.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-charm-bracelet\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Dainty Rose Gold Charm Bracelet\\\" \\\"PC-JWL-BRC-02\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Awaiting authorized supplier or studio photo\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'No exact official manufacturer or authorized distributor photograph with verified reuse permission found for SKU PC-JWL-BRC-02. Current image preserved unchanged.\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        productId: \'prod-quartz-necklace\',\\n        query: \'\\\"Pretty Charm\\\" \\\"Blush Quartz Layered Necklace\\\" \\\"PC-JWL-NCK-03\\\"\',\\n        status: \'Image Needed\',\\n        candidateUrl: null,\\n        sourceUrl: null,\\n        license: \'Awaiting authorized supplier or studio photo\',\\n        reason:\\n          \'No exact official manufacturer or authorized distributor photograph with verified reuse permission found for SKU PC-JWL-NCK-03. Current image preserved unchanged.\',\\n      },\\n    ];\\n\\n    for (const item of initialAudits) {\\n      insertAudit.run(\\n        item.productId,\\n        item.query,\\n        item.status,\\n        item.candidateUrl,\\n        item.sourceUrl,\\n        item.license,\\n        item.reason,\\n        now\\n      );\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // Save baseline product integrity snapshot in store_settings if not already saved\\n  const existingBaseline = db\\n    .prepare(\\\"SELECT value_json FROM store_settings WHERE key = \'catalogue_integrity_baseline\'\\\")\\n    .get() as { value_json: string } | undefined;\\n  if (!existingBaseline) {\\n    const prods = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY id ASC\').all() as any[];\\n    const vars = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM product_variants ORDER BY id ASC\').all() as any[];\\n    const snapshot = prods.map((p) => ({\\n      id: p.id,\\n      name: p.name,\\n      slug: p.slug,\\n      categorySlug: p.category_slug,\\n      sku: p.sku,\\n      sellingPricePaise: p.selling_price_paise,\\n      stockQty: p.stock_qty,\\n      status: p.status,\\n      variantSkus: vars.filter((v) => v.product_id === p.id).map((v) => v.sku),\\n    }));\\n    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO store_settings (key, value_json, updated_at) VALUES (\'catalogue_integrity_baseline\', ?, ?)\\n    `).run(JSON.stringify(snapshot), now);\\n  }\\n}\", \"StartLine\":826, \"TargetContent\":\"    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO admin_users (id, email, full_name, role, password_hash, password_salt, is_active, created_at)\\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, \'owner\', ?, ?, 1, ?)\\n    `).run(\\n      \'admin-owner-1\',\\n      process.env.ADMIN_INITIAL_EMAIL.trim().toLowerCase(),\\n      \'Pretty Charm Owner\',\\n      hash,\\n      salt,\\n      now\\n    );\\n  }\\n}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/server/db.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding product_image_audits table and seeding in src/server/db.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add product_image_audits table in db.ts\"}"
