  planner_response {
    response: "I have inspected the existing **Pretty Charm** SQLite database (`./data/pretty_charm.sqlite`), audited the **10 existing products**, searched using their exact names, brand (`Pretty Charm`), variants, and SKUs, and implemented the non-destructive **Original Product Photo Audit, Verification & Admin Approval Workflow + Admin Image Report** without altering any existing product records.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1 & Step 2: Existing Product Checklist & Search Findings\n\nAll **10 existing products** in the database are proprietary **Pretty Charm** studio SKUs (`PC-HMP-*`, `PC-HAIR-*`, `PC-JWL-*`). Web searches for the exact product names, brand, variants, and SKUs confirmed that:\n- None of the 10 proprietary SKUs have publicly licensed original manufacturer photographs on external repositories.\n- Third-party retailers (`queenmee.com`, `houseofwhitemulberry.com`, `jewelrybyshinestar.com`) list similarly named generic items, but they are not the exact Pretty Charm Gurugram SKU/packaging and do not grant commercial image reuse permission. Per your rules, similar third-party photos and AI-generated images were **not** substituted or published.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3 & Step 4: Admin Image Report (All 10 Existing Products)\n\n| # | Product ID | Product Name | Category | Variant(s) | SKU | Price | Stock | Product Status | Image Audit Status | Source URL | Reason |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `prod-mini-hamper` | **Pretty Charm Mini Hamper** | `gift-hampers` | \342\200\224 | `PC-HMP-MINI` | \342\202\271299 | 0 | `draft` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | Custom Gurugram studio gift hamper (`PC-HMP-MINI`). No external manufacturer or authorized distributor catalogue carries this bespoke SKU. |\n| 2 | `prod-bestie-box` | **Pretty Charm Bestie Box** | `gift-hampers` | \342\200\224 | `PC-HMP-BESTIE` | \342\202\271299 | 0 | `draft` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | Custom Gurugram studio gift hamper (`PC-HMP-BESTIE`). No external manufacturer or authorized distributor catalogue carries this bespoke SKU. |\n| 3 | `prod-premium-box` | **Pretty Charm Premium Box** | `gift-hampers` | \342\200\224 | `PC-HMP-PREM` | \342\202\271449 | 0 | `draft` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | Custom Gurugram studio gift hamper (`PC-HMP-PREM`). No external manufacturer or authorized distributor catalogue carries this bespoke SKU. |\n| 4 | `prod-celebration-box` | **Pretty Charm Celebration Box** | `gift-hampers` | \342\200\224 | `PC-HMP-CELEB` | \342\202\271449 | 0 | `draft` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | Custom Gurugram studio gift hamper (`PC-HMP-CELEB`). No external manufacturer or authorized distributor catalogue carries this bespoke SKU. |\n| 5 | `prod-pearl-claw` | **Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw** | `hair-accessories` | Blush Pearl (`PC-HAIR-CLAW-01-BL`), Champagne Pearl (`PC-HAIR-CLAW-01-CH`) | `PC-HAIR-CLAW-01` | \342\202\271249 | 18 | `active` | **Source or reuse permission unverified** | `https://queenmee.com` | Third-party boutique listings exist for similar rose gold pearl hair claws, but they do not match proprietary SKU `PC-HAIR-CLAW-01` and commercial image reuse is not permitted. |\n| 6 | `prod-silk-scrunchie-trio` | **Mulberry Silk Scrunchie Trio** | `hair-accessories` | Blush/Cream/Rose Trio (`PC-HAIR-SCR-03-SET1`), Champagne Trio (`PC-HAIR-SCR-03-SET2`) | `PC-HAIR-SCR-03` | \342\202\271199 | 24 | `active` | **Source or reuse permission unverified** | `https://houseofwhitemulberry.com` | Third-party mulberry silk scrunchie sets found online belong to separate brands without commercial image reuse rights or exact colourway verification for `PC-HAIR-SCR-03`. |\n| 7 | `prod-satin-bow-barrette` | **Blush Satin Pearl Bow Barrette** | `hair-accessories` | \342\200\224 | `PC-HAIR-BOW-02` | \342\202\271179 | 4 | `active` | **Source or reuse permission unverified** | `https://jewelrybyshinestar.com` | External listings found for satin pearl bow barrettes are copyrighted third-party boutique photographs without reuse authorization or exact variant verification for `PC-HAIR-BOW-02`. |\n| 8 | `prod-pearl-drop-huggies` | **Rose Gold Pearl Drop Huggies** | `jewellery` | Classic Pearl Drop (`PC-JWL-EAR-01-CL`), Petite Pav\303\251 Hoop (`PC-JWL-EAR-01-PV`) | `PC-JWL-EAR-01` | \342\202\271349 | 14 | `active` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | No authorized supplier or brand-owned studio photograph with verified reuse rights found for proprietary SKU `PC-JWL-EAR-01`. |\n| 9 | `prod-charm-bracelet` | **Dainty Rose Gold Charm Bracelet** | `jewellery` | \342\200\224 | `PC-JWL-BRC-02` | \342\202\271399 | 11 | `active` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | No authorized supplier or brand-owned studio photograph with verified reuse rights found for proprietary SKU `PC-JWL-BRC-02`. |\n| 10 | `prod-quartz-necklace` | **Blush Quartz Layered Necklace** | `jewellery` | \342\200\224 | `PC-JWL-NCK-03` | \342\202\271429 | 3 | `active` | **Image Needed** | \342\200\224 | No authorized supplier or brand-owned studio photograph with verified reuse rights found for proprietary SKU `PC-JWL-NCK-03`. |\n\n---\n\n### What Was Added to the Admin Panel & Backend\n\n1. **Admin Image Report & Approval Panel (`Admin -> 2. Products & Drafts`)**:\n   - Displays all 5 required status counters (`Original image found \342\200\224 awaiting approval`, `Image successfully added`, `Image Needed`, `Source or reuse permission unverified`, `Search failed`).\n   - Shows each existing product\'s current image preview, staged candidate preview, source URL, license notes, status badge, and reason.\n   - Provides **Search Permitted Sources**, **Stage Original Photo** (validating MIME type `jpeg/png/webp`, file size `128 B \342\200\223 10 MB`, exact product/variant match, reuse permission, and AI-image exclusion), and **Approve / Reject** actions.\n   - When approving a candidate photo, updates **only** `images_json` on that existing product, preserving existing gallery images by default (unless replacement is explicitly chosen) and setting the approved photo as the primary image only after confirmation.\n\n---\n\n### Final Verification (Before vs. After)\n\n- **Total Existing Products**: `10` before $\\rightarrow$ `10` after (**100% unchanged**)\n- **Product IDs, Names, Slugs, Descriptions, SKUs, Categories, Variants, Prices & Stock**: Verified identical (`10/10` unchanged, `0` discrepancies via `verifyCatalogueIntegrityUnchanged`).\n- **Existing Products with Approved External Original Images**: `0`\n- **Existing Products Still Needing Original Photos**: `10` (`7` marked `Image Needed`, `3` marked `Source or reuse permission unverified` with their existing images preserved untouched)."
