  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Checkout Thumbnails**\n\nI\'m focusing on the Checkout screen, specifically lines 1995-2045 within `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m now adding a mini item thumbnail list within the \"2. Payment & Order Review\" section. This will directly fulfill the requirement for explicit \"Checkout thumbnails\" as outlined in step 6 of the process.\n\n\n**Implementing Admin Features**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to the Admin Dashboard (`/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx`). I\'m adding comprehensive image management controls per Step 5. This includes new state variables to track image processing stages and handlers for finding, approving, and generating AI fallback images. I\'m also adding a new UI section to the product tab with an action bar and buttons for these tasks.\n\n\n**Defining Admin Controls**\n\nI\'m now detailing the UI controls for image management within the admin dashboard. I\'m focusing on the `/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx` file, specifically the product image management section. I\'m mapping out the components and `data-testid` attributes needed to implement batch and per-product actions such as approving, reviewing, and searching for images. I\'m also planning the status summary cards to visualize the image processing state, as well as an image preview modal for detailed inspection of images.\n\n\n"
