  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Image Display**\n\nI\'m now focused on verifying image displays using `playwright-cli`. Specifically, I\'m checking the home page to confirm all six active products show their images, ensuring they\'re sourced correctly from `/uploads/products/*.jpg` and have a `naturalWidth > 0`. Next, I\'ll be validating the image displays on category pages and product listing cards, mirroring the same checks for consistency.\n\n\n**Expanding Image Validation**\n\nI\'m now expanding image validation to include product detail pages, search results, and cart/checkout thumbnails. I\'m verifying that clicking a product displays the correct `/uploads/products/*.jpg` image with a `naturalWidth > 0`. Searching for \"Pearl\" or \"Silk\" ensures matching products show up with images. Also, I\'m checking that product thumbnails in the cart and checkout also use the same image. Finally, I\'m confirming that page reloads preserve all imported images in SQLite, and I am logging in as owner to verify image management in admin.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_446877"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"playwright-cli open http://localhost:3000 --viewport 1440x900 && playwright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"enter-store-btn\\\\\\\"]\', { timeout: 10000 });\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"enter-store-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-card-img-rose-gold-pearl-hair-claw\\\\\\\"]\', { timeout: 10000 });\\n\\n  // 1. Verify Home page product sections (all 6 active products)\\n  const homeImages = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const imgs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"product-card-img-\\\\\\\"]\'));\\n    return imgs.map(img => ({\\n      testId: img.getAttribute(\'data-testid\'),\\n      src: img.getAttribute(\'src\'),\\n      complete: img.complete,\\n      naturalWidth: img.naturalWidth,\\n      naturalHeight: img.naturalHeight\\n    }));\\n  });\\n\\n  // 2. Navigate to Shop / Category page & Search results\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"hero-shop-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-sort-select\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  const shopImages = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const imgs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"product-card-img-\\\\\\\"]\'));\\n    return imgs.map(img => ({\\n      testId: img.getAttribute(\'data-testid\'),\\n      src: img.getAttribute(\'src\'),\\n      naturalWidth: img.naturalWidth\\n    }));\\n  });\\n\\n  // 3. Click into Product Detail page for Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-card-img-rose-gold-pearl-hair-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-detail-main-image\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  const detailCheck = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const main = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-detail-main-image\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const thumb0 = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-detail-thumb-0\\\\\\\"] img\');\\n    const thumb1 = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"product-detail-thumb-1\\\\\\\"] img\');\\n    return {\\n      mainSrc: main?.getAttribute(\'src\'),\\n      mainNaturalWidth: main?.naturalWidth,\\n      thumb0Src: thumb0?.getAttribute(\'src\'),\\n      thumb1SrcPrefix: thumb1?.getAttribute(\'src\')?.slice(0, 30),\\n      galleryCount: document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"product-detail-thumb-\\\\\\\"]\').length\\n    };\\n  });\\n\\n  // 4. Add to Cart & verify Cart + Checkout thumbnails\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"detail-add-to-cart\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"header-cart-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"cart-item-thumb-prod-pearl-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  const cartThumb = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const img = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"cart-item-thumb-prod-pearl-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    return { src: img?.getAttribute(\'src\'), naturalWidth: img?.naturalWidth };\\n  });\\n\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"proceed-to-checkout-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"checkout-item-thumb-prod-pearl-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  const checkoutThumb = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const img = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"checkout-item-thumb-prod-pearl-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    return { src: img?.getAttribute(\'src\'), naturalWidth: img?.naturalWidth };\\n  });\\n\\n  // 5. Verify Admin Image Management & Catalogue Integrity\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"open-admin-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'input[type=\\\\\\\"password\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.fill(\'input[type=\\\\\\\"password\\\\\\\"]\', \'PrettyCharm#2026\');\\n  await page.click(\'button[type=\\\\\\\"submit\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'button:has-text(\\\\\\\"2. Products & Drafts\\\\\\\")\');\\n  await page.click(\'button:has-text(\\\\\\\"2. Products & Drafts\\\\\\\")\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"admin-image-report\\\\\\\"]\');\\n\\n  const adminReportBefore = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const badge = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"catalogue-integrity-badge\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent?.trim();\\n    const statuses = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"image-status-\\\\\\\"]\')).map(el => ({\\n      id: el.getAttribute(\'data-testid\'),\\n      status: el.textContent?.trim()\\n    }));\\n    const findAllBtn = Boolean(document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"find-all-available-images-btn\\\\\\\"]\'));\\n    const reviewAiBtn = Boolean(document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"review-ai-images-btn\\\\\\\"]\'));\\n    return { badge, statuses, findAllBtn, reviewAiBtn };\\n  });\\n\\n  // Click Find Images for All Available Products and Preview Image\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"find-all-available-images-btn\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n  await page.click(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"preview-image-prod-pearl-claw\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"image-preview-modal\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  const modalOpen = await page.isVisible(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"image-preview-modal\\\\\\\"]\');\\n\\n  return {\\n    homeImages,\\n    shopImagesCount: shopImages.length,\\n    detailCheck,\\n    cartThumb,\\n    checkoutThumb,\\n    adminReportBefore,\\n    modalOpen\\n  };\\n}\\\" && playwright-cli close\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Verifying storefront and admin images in headless Chromium\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify storefront and admin images in headless Chromium\"}"
