  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Pure Functions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing pure functions within `/src/shared/domainLogic.ts`, specifically for homepage curation and verified storefront helpers. I plan to unit-test these functions in `/src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts`. For the initial implementation, I\'m working on `getHomepageFeaturedProducts<T>` and ensuring its type safety.\n\n\n**Refining Filter Logic**\n\nI\'ve refined the filtering logic for featured products, ensuring only active and available items are returned. I\'m focusing on `getHomepageFeaturedProducts` and the sorting criteria (featured status then price) to ensure the homepage displays desired items, and filtering ensures no archived, draft, or out-of-stock items will ever be returned. I\'m also ensuring the type safety of each function. I\'m also considering the `getHomepageGiftHampers` function. Finally, `getVerifiedWhyShopBenefits` is being created to extract information from the admin-configured benefits.\n\n\n**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now building out the `/src/components/PremiumHomepage.tsx` component. This will allow for a well-structured and maintainable redesigned homepage, maintaining consistency with existing elements. I am also implementing `buildInstagramProfileUrl`, a function which correctly formats Instagram profile URLs. The component includes the redesigned announcement bar, header with search and navigation, and footer with working links.\n\n\n**Analyzing Category Images**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the category images, ensuring the homepage displays correct visuals. For \"Hair Accessories\" and \"Jewellery\", I\'ll show real product photos, sourced from the database. Categories like \"Gift Hampers\" and \"Coming Soon\" will use custom illustrations. The hero section will show the real Pretty Charm products in a rose-gold-themed gallery. I\'m focusing on ensuring `/src/server/db.ts` and `/src/components/PremiumHomepage.tsx` align correctly, to achieve the desired effect.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_479164"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add Section 12 homepage curation, verified benefits, and Instagram URL helpers to src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"EndLine\":1071, \"Instruction\":\"Append Section 12 helper functions to src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  return {\\n    unchanged: discrepancies.length === 0,\\n    discrepancies,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n// ============================================================================\\n// 12. PREMIUM HOMEPAGE CURATION, VERIFIED BENEFITS & SOCIAL LINK HELPERS\\n// ============================================================================\\n\\nexport interface HomepageProductCandidate {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  slug?: string;\\n  categorySlug?: string;\\n  status?: ProductStatus | string;\\n  sellingPricePaise: number;\\n  availableQty?: number;\\n  stockQty?: number;\\n  reservedQty?: number;\\n  featured?: boolean;\\n  images?: string[];\\n  variants?: Array<{ id: string; name: string; priceDeltaPaise?: number }>;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Returns only active, in-stock products from the database for the Featured Products section.\\n * Never returns draft, coming-soon, archived, or out-of-stock items as purchasable featured items.\\n */\\nexport function getHomepageFeaturedProducts<T extends HomepageProductCandidate>(\\n  products: readonly T[]\\n): T[] {\\n  return products\\n    .filter((p) => {\\n      if (p.status !== \'active\') return false;\\n      const avail =\\n        typeof p.availableQty === \'number\'\\n          ? p.availableQty\\n          : Math.max(0, Number(p.stockQty || 0) - Number(p.reservedQty || 0));\\n      return avail > 0;\\n    })\\n    .sort((a, b) => {\\n      const aFeat = a.featured ? 1 : 0;\\n      const bFeat = b.featured ? 1 : 0;\\n      if (aFeat !== bFeat) return bFeat - aFeat;\\n      return a.sellingPricePaise - b.sellingPricePaise;\\n    });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Returns saved Gift Hampers from the database without inventing contents or hiding draft state.\\n */\\nexport function getHomepageGiftHampers<T extends HomepageProductCandidate>(\\n  products: readonly T[]\\n): T[] {\\n  return products.filter(\\n    (p) => p.categorySlug === \'gift-hampers\' && p.status !== \'archived\'\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WhyShopBenefit {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Builds verified \\\"Why Shop With Us\\\" benefits using Admin-configured settings and live shipping rules.\\n * Never claims unverified free shipping on all orders, guaranteed delivery dates, or unverified certifications.\\n */\\nexport function getVerifiedWhyShopBenefits(\\n  generalSettings: Record<string, any> = {},\\n  shippingRules: ShippingRuleConfig = DEFAULT_SHIPPING_RULES\\n): ReadonlyArray<WhyShopBenefit> {\\n  const custom = generalSettings?.whyShopBenefits || {};\\n  const origin = generalSettings?.shippingOrigin || \'Gurugram, Haryana (PIN 122001)\';\\n\\n  return [\\n    {\\n      id: \'thoughtful-selection\',\\n      title: custom.selectionTitle || \'Thoughtfully selected products\',\\n      description:\\n        custom.selectionDescription ||\\n        \'Satin and pearl hair accessories, anti-tarnish demifine jewellery, and keepsake gift boxes with clear item specifications.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'secure-ordering\',\\n      title: custom.orderingTitle || \'Secure ordering process\',\\n      description:\\n        custom.orderingDescription ||\\n        \'Transparent prices in Indian Rupees (INR), server-verified order totals, real-time stock reservation, and guest or account checkout.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'shipping-info\',\\n      title: custom.shippingTitle || \'Shipping information\',\\n      description:\\n        custom.shippingDescription ||\\n        `Dispatched from ${origin}. Standard pan-India shipping is ${formatINR(\\n          shippingRules.tier1FeePaise\\n        )} below ${formatINR(shippingRules.tier1MaxSubtotalPaise)}, ${formatINR(\\n          shippingRules.tier2FeePaise\\n        )} up to ${formatINR(\\n          shippingRules.freeShippingThresholdPaise - 100\\n        )}, and Free on orders ${formatINR(shippingRules.freeShippingThresholdPaise)}+.`,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'customer-support\',\\n      title: custom.supportTitle || \'Customer support\',\\n      description:\\n        custom.supportDescription ||\\n        \'Direct assistance via WhatsApp Click-to-Chat and email for product questions, order updates, and AWB shipment tracking.\',\\n    },\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\nexport function buildInstagramProfileUrl(rawHandle?: string): {\\n  handle: string;\\n  cleanHandle: string;\\n  url: string;\\n} {\\n  const cleaned = String(rawHandle || \'prettycharm.in\')\\n    .trim()\\n    .replace(/^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(www\\\\.)?instagram\\\\.com\\\\//i, \'\')\\n    .replace(/^@+/, \'\')\\n    .replace(/\\\\/+$/, \'\')\\n    .replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9._]/g, \'\');\\n  const finalHandle = cleaned || \'prettycharm.in\';\\n  return {\\n    handle: `@${finalHandle}`,\\n    cleanHandle: finalHandle,\\n    url: `https://www.instagram.com/${encodeURIComponent(finalHandle)}`,\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":1064, \"TargetContent\":\"  return {\\n    unchanged: discrepancies.length === 0,\\n    discrepancies,\\n  };\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/shared/domainLogic.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding homepage helper functions to domainLogic.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add homepage helper functions to domainLogic.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\245&\n\242&\001i\024}\023p\334\351\2776\215V\200\251h\353r\224.\256V\344V\243&\300\326\365\227X\325j\a\024\226B\2430\a\220\357\277\372\310\362\021\210{r\314\031\305\235\355\"\337o\250R\201\334\334\3365\3532\346\375F\307pG)\355]\030\230\200du\330F\360\203q\031\354\020\316\020\203x\262Y\214\210\f\222*\237\332\256\363g\032\003=\333e\300\245d\\\203\207)\n5\244\256\366\352JN\241\361\325\004\n\035\"\242\370\037o\330\347\250\211\0238\367ld\005*\017e\310@5xaB\"R\325`\346\017\312D\321!M\337|=h\'\322\237\313/\303\374\366\203\260\033/N\366\205\022\017l\024\375\'\247\311\313\254\354M\327\2558C\304\266\\tb\263\217\365\"\343\363-\312\006\b\305\203\336\273\032\227\356r\271\333\2775O6\0378\035\246\346\201\347\3272\264\200\261y^\341\305$9&cuZ\312\234N\317r\'\362\362\237:.d\327\002\240k&~\030\344\022\305\240\203y`\223\316\260\3506\224\221\316U,m\215\243\033\022y\323\257wo\035\257a\213E\271#\314\a\271\331\345\260\214\317\307\006\352-\214\356|\334\251\222I\241\'\352\317i\305x\211\324\340\331CoL(\315\023\312\260\244\224\rk\252\034\363\366\227\2427\374\374,\264\307\205\316\235\215\221\230\263;]#\215\245\253%\\\005\370\222\211\025b=\336V\001!\320\246i\rd\333\232\336\303\345j\036\004;6\266\240\017\342\251\320\301\237+\311\365_\265(\255*~\025\"I\203C\006\2315\200\270_W\322\331ie\321\200\263\315\\$\320\025\207\372\256m\327Q\213\322\322M\035\226\205cU\321\233\370g7\376\225U\305L\342-*\314\215 \307OE\352\b:\341JP%O\f\305Rt\323?\350\203\245FP=\307\374\242\177\241y\027\033q\n\334\242\364\3647\003\216\304\024\022&\036\303F\275F$\374\263g\270\203\327\253\020\257\002\231\364U].16wS\257Br~\213\34405\304d\307\303\324\021\016\331p\037Uk\240\320jc\346a\"\224\021\256\363\\\037\233\003N\253\025\357\274\230C\253>F\204\025\334b]}W\303\233Q\314\215\242\027|\262y@I\\~\250\003\021\247+h\311\326?\177D\256\277\224\277&\303\016N\256\357\030\342\310\236a\177\256\355?_\342\340\301-F\342\030\035\002\354Q\0309\222\343\301\346\vIp]W\252t`:\260b\004\336kk\315%\232\271 TP\343a\233lZ\3259