  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Redesign **only the homepage** of the existing **Pretty Charm** e-commerce website into a premium, editorial, feminine layout (soft blush pink, warm cream, subtle rose gold) using real database records and existing routes/cart/wishlist/checkout/admin functionality.\n   - **Required Homepage Sections (A\342\200\223K)**:\n     - **A. Announcement Bar**: Slim, elegant Admin-configurable top bar (`generalSettings.announcementBanner`).\n     - **B. Header**: Pretty Charm logo, search products field, account/wishlist/cart icons, clean navigation (`Home`, `Gift Hampers`, `Hair Accessories`, `Jewellery`, `Coming Soon`), and mobile-friendly menu drawer.\n     - **C. Premium Hero Section**: Editorial split layout featuring real available Pretty Charm products (`/uploads/products/prod-pearl-claw.jpg`, `/uploads/products/prod-pearl-drop-huggies.jpg`, `/uploads/products/prod-silk-scrunchie-trio.jpg`), exact headline `\"Little Things. Beautiful Moments.\"`, supporting text `\"Thoughtfully chosen gifts and pretty essentials for moments worth celebrating.\"`, Primary CTA `\"Shop Gift Hampers\"`, and Secondary CTA `\"Explore Accessories\"`.\n     - **D. Shop by Category**: Category cards for `Gift Hampers`, `Hair Accessories`, `Jewellery`, `Cosmetics & Beauty \342\200\224 Coming Soon`, and `Festive Collection \342\200\224 Coming Soon` (Coming Soon categories must not be purchasable).\n     - **E. Featured Products**: Displays actual `status === \'active\' && availableQty > 0` products from SQLite with genuine product image, actual name, current selling price in INR, variant summary, wishlist button, and `View Product` + `Add to Cart` actions (no fake discounts or fake ratings).\n     - **F. Gift Hampers Collection**: Dedicated section for saved gift hampers with `\"View All Hampers\"` link and honest saved Draft/Active status.\n     - **G. Brand Story**: Compact editorial section on thoughtful gifting and everyday accessories without fabricated history/founder claims.\n     - **H. Why Shop With Us**: 4 verified, Admin-configurable benefits (`Thoughtfully selected products`, `Secure ordering process`, `Shipping information`, `Customer support`).\n     - **I. Instagram Section**: `\"Follow Pretty Charm\"` section linking to the Admin-configured Instagram profile (`@prettycharm.in`) without a fake live feed or fabricated followers.\n     - **J. Newsletter or Offers**: Clearly labelled disabled placeholder in development (`Newsletter & Offers \302\267 Disabled in Development`).\n     - **K. Footer**: Working links to `About Us`, `Contact`, `FAQ`, `Shipping Policy`, `Returns and Refunds`, `Privacy Policy`, `Terms and Conditions`, `Instagram`, and `WhatsApp support`.\n   - **Responsive & Verification Requirements**:\n     - Test at widths `360px`, `375px`, `390px`, `430px`, tablet (`768px`), and desktop (`1440px`) with zero horizontal overflow (`scrollWidth <= clientWidth`).\n     - Run unit tests, `lint_applet`, `compile_applet`, and report changed files, passing tests, and any missing images or incomplete features.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - **Domain Logic (`/src/shared/domainLogic.ts` Section 12)**: Added `getHomepageFeaturedProducts`, `getHomepageGiftHampers`, `getVerifiedWhyShopBenefits`, and `buildInstagramProfileUrl`.\n     - **Unit Tests (`/src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts` Test #14)**: Added unit test #14 covering featured product filtering (excluding drafts and 0-stock items), gift hampers filtering, verified \"Why Shop With Us\" benefits with live shipping tiers, and Instagram profile URL sanitization.\n     - **Modular Homepage Component (`/src/components/PremiumHomepage.tsx`)**: Created the complete redesigned homepage implementing Sections C through J (`homepage-hero-section`, `homepage-categories-section`, `homepage-featured-section`, `homepage-hampers-section`, `homepage-brand-story`, `homepage-why-shop-section`, `homepage-instagram-section`, `homepage-newsletter-section`).\n     - **Main App Shell (`/src/App.tsx`)**:\n       - Set default landing screen to `\'home\'` (`initialScreenParam || \'home\'`), while keeping `\'splash\'` accessible via `?screen=splash` or Footer.\n       - Updated Section A (`announcement-bar`), Section B (`header` with desktop/mobile search inputs, `Home` / `Gift Hampers` / `Hair Accessories` / `Jewellery` / `Coming Soon` nav links, account/wishlist/cart/admin icons, and accessible `mobile-nav-drawer`), Section C\342\200\223J (`<PremiumHomepage ... />`), and Section K (`site-footer` with all required working links).\n   - **Remaining**:\n     - Add Admin configuration inputs for `announcementBanner` and `whyShopBenefits` in `/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx` (around line 2840 in `13. WhatsApp & Instagram Integrations` / `14. Store Settings`) so Admin can edit the Announcement Bar and Why Shop With Us text from the dashboard.\n     - Run unit tests (`npx --yes tsx --test src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts`), `lint_applet`, `compile_applet`, and `restart_dev_server`.\n     - Verify in headless Chromium (`playwright-cli`) across `360px`, `375px`, `390px`, `430px`, `768px`, and `1440px` viewports, checking zero horizontal overflow, hero CTAs, header search, category cards, featured products, gift hampers, Instagram link, and footer links.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Because HMR is disabled (`DISABLE_HMR=true`), `restart_dev_server` must always be called after editing frontend files before inspecting `http://localhost:3000` with `playwright-cli`.\n   - `store_settings` key `\'general\'` in `./data/pretty_charm.sqlite` stores `announcementBanner`, `instagramHandle`, `supportWhatsapp`, and supports arbitrary JSON keys merged via `POST /api/admin/settings` (`handleUpdateSettings` in `AdminDashboard.tsx`).\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - `/src/components/PremiumHomepage.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/shared/domainLogic.ts`, and `/src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts` are updated and ready.\n   - `/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx` lines 2833\342\200\2232875 contain the `integrations` / `settings` tabs where we can add the Admin input for `announcementBanner`.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Add Announcement Bar & Why Shop With Us Config Inputs in `/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx`** (lines 2835\342\200\2232875).\n   2. **Run Unit Tests, Lint, Compile & Restart Dev Server**:\n      - `npx --yes tsx --test src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts`\n      - `lint_applet` and `compile_applet`\n      - `restart_dev_server`\n   3. **Browser & Responsive Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n      - Open `http://localhost:3000` and verify all sections A\342\200\223K, interactive CTAs (`Shop Gift Hampers`, `Explore Accessories`, `Add to Cart`, `View Product`, `View All Hampers`, mobile menu toggle, search), and check `scrollWidth <= clientWidth` at widths `360`, `375`, `390`, `430`, `768`, and `1440`.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Do not invent products, prices, discounts, reviews, or stock.\n   - Do not modify checkout or payment behaviour.\n   - Report which homepage files changed, which tests passed, and any missing images or incomplete features.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 301
