 generic [ref=e55]: Transparent INR Pricing\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e56]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e57]: Pan-India Dispatch\n        - img \"Pretty Charm Signature Piece\" [ref=e62] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e65]:\n        - generic [ref=e66]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e67]: Collections\n          - heading \"Shop by Category\" [level=2] [ref=e68]\n        - button \"Browse All Categories\" [ref=e69] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e74]:\n        - generic [ref=e75]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e76]: In Stock \302\267 Ready to Ship\n          - heading \"Featured Products\" [level=2] [ref=e77]\n          - paragraph [ref=e78]: Every piece below reflects live inventory from our Gurugram studio.\n        - button \"View Full Catalogue\" [ref=e79] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e84]:\n        - generic [ref=e85]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e86]: Signature Keepsake Boxes\n          - heading \"Gift Hampers Collection\" [level=2] [ref=e87]\n          - paragraph [ref=e88]: Explore our curated gift hamper collection below. Items marked as Draft display their saved proposed prices and open for ordering as soon as box contents and stock are confirmed in the Admin Panel.\n        - button \"View All Hampers\" [ref=e89] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e94]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e95]: The Pretty Charm Philosophy\n        - heading \"Thoughtful Gifting & Everyday Finishing Touches\" [level=2] [ref=e96]\n        - paragraph [ref=e97]: Pretty Charm brings together soft satin hair accessories, pearl-accented claws, dainty rose-gold toned jewellery, and keepsake gift hampers. Whether you are choosing a small gesture for someone dear or a quiet everyday essential for yourself, every piece in our catalogue is listed with clear specifications and honest availability.\n      - generic [ref=e98]:\n        - generic [ref=e99]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e100]: Verified Store Commitments\n          - heading \"Why Shop With Us\" [level=2] [ref=e101]\n        - generic [ref=e102]:\n          - generic [ref=e103]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e104]: \"01.\"\n            - heading \"Thoughtfully selected products\" [level=3] [ref=e105]\n            - paragraph [ref=e106]: Satin and pearl hair accessories, anti-tarnish demifine jewellery, and keepsake gift boxes with clear item specifications.\n          - generic [ref=e107]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e108]: \"02.\"\n            - heading \"Secure ordering process\" [level=3] [ref=e109]\n            - paragraph [ref=e110]: Transparent prices in Indian Rupees (INR), server-verified order totals, real-time stock reservation, and guest or account checkout.\n          - generic [ref=e111]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e112]: \"03.\"\n            - heading \"Shipping information\" [level=3] [ref=e113]\n            - paragraph [ref=e114]: Dispatched from Gurugram, Haryana (PIN 122001). Standard pan-India shipping is \342\202\27159 below \342\202\271499, \342\202\27139 up to \342\202\271998, and Free on orders \342\202\271999+.\n          - generic [ref=e115]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e116]: \"04.\"\n            - heading \"Customer support\" [level=3] [ref=e117]\n            - paragraph [ref=e118]: Direct assistance via WhatsApp Click-to-Chat and email for product questions, order updates, and AWB shipment tracking.\n      - generic [ref=e119]:\n        - generic [ref=e120]:\n          - generic [ref=e121]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e122]: Official Social Profile\n            - heading \"Follow Pretty Charm\" [level=2] [ref=e123]\n            - paragraph [ref=e124]:\n              - text: Connect with us on Instagram at\n              - strong [ref=e125]: \"@prettycharm.in\"\n              - text: for new accessory arrivals, hamper release announcements, and styling inspiration.\n          - link \"Follow @prettycharm.in on Instagram\" [ref=e127] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.instagram.com/prettycharm.in\n        - generic [ref=e131]:\n          - generic [ref=e132]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e133]: Newsletter & Offers \302\267 Disabled in Development\n            - heading \"Studio Updates & Releases\" [level=2] [ref=e134]\n            - paragraph [ref=e135]: Email subscription is currently a disabled placeholder until a privacy-compliant mailing service is configured by the store administrator.\n          - generic [ref=e136]:\n            - textbox \"Email address (disabled in development)\" [disabled] [ref=e137]:\n              - /placeholder: Newsletter signup disabled in dev\n            - button \"Coming Soon\" [disabled] [ref=e138]\n  - contentinfo [ref=e139]:\n    - generic [ref=e140]:\n      - generic [ref=e141]:\n        - generic [ref=e142]: Pretty Charm\n        - paragraph [ref=e143]: Curated gift hampers, satin hair accessories & demifine jewellery dispatched pan-India from Gurugram, Haryana (122001).\n      - generic [ref=e144]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e145]: Explore & Care\n        - list [ref=e146]:\n          - listitem [ref=e147]:\n            - button \"About Us\" [ref=e148] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e149]:\n            - button \"Contact\" [ref=e150] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e151]:\n            - button \"FAQ\" [ref=e152] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e153]:\n            - button \"Track My Order\" [ref=e154] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e155]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e156]: Policies\n        - list [ref=e157]:\n          - listitem [ref=e158]:\n            - button \"Shipping Policy\" [ref=e159] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e160]:\n            - button \"Returns and Refunds\" [ref=e161] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e162]:\n            - button \"Privacy Policy\" [ref=e163] [cursor=pointer]\n          - listitem [ref=e164]:\n            - button \"Terms and Conditions\" [ref=e165] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e166]:\n        - paragr