tory as COGSok 10 - 10. Profit reporting excludes unpaid/demo orders and never counts unsold inventory as COGS  ---  duration_ms: 0.804842  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: 11. Spreadsheet formula injection escaping & WhatsApp URL sanitizationok 11 - 11. Spreadsheet formula injection escaping & WhatsApp URL sanitization  ---  duration_ms: 0.50525  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: 12. Product listing & Category Page sorting (Price: Low to High, Price: High to Low, Newest Arrivals)ok 12 - 12. Product listing & Category Page sorting (Price: Low to High, Price: High to Low, Newest Arrivals)  ---  duration_ms: 1.932545  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: 13. Product image eligibility, validation, AI fallback metadata labeling, gallery update & catalogue integrity checkok 13 - 13. Product image eligibility, validation, AI fallback metadata labeling, gallery update & catalogue integrity check  ---  duration_ms: 1.578523  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: 14. Homepage featured products, gift hampers filter, verified benefits & Instagram profile URL helperok 14 - 14. Homepage featured products, gift hampers filter, verified benefits & Instagram profile URL helper  ---  duration_ms: 1.03747  type: \'test\'  ...1..14# tests 14# suites 0# pass 14# fail 0# cancelled 0# skipped 0# todo 0# duration_ms 297.838269"
