  planner_response {
    response: "I have redesigned the **Pretty Charm** homepage into a refined, editorial e-commerce layout (soft blush pink, warm cream, and rose-gold accents) while preserving all existing database records, routes, cart/wishlist state, checkout flows, and Admin Panel tools.\n\n### 1. Summary of Redesigned Homepage Sections (A\342\200\223K)\n\n- **A. Announcement Bar (`announcement-bar`)**: Slim top bar displaying the Admin-configurable announcement (`generalSettings.announcementBanner`), defaulting to the live Gurugram studio shipping tiers (`\342\202\27159` below `\342\202\271499`, `\342\202\27139` for `\342\202\271499\342\200\223\342\202\271998`, and `Free Shipping` on `\342\202\271999+`). Editable directly in **Admin Panel \342\206\222 14. Store Settings**.\n- **B. Header & Navigation**:\n  - **Pretty Charm \302\267 Gurugram Studio** brand wordmark.\n  - Desktop & mobile product search bars wired to the live catalogue filter.\n  - Clean navigation for **Home**, **Gift Hampers**, **Hair Accessories**, **Jewellery**, and **Coming Soon** categories, plus an accessible mobile navigation drawer (`mobile-nav-drawer`).\n  - Account, Wishlist (with live count badge), Shopping Bag (with live count badge), and Admin controls.\n- **C. Premium Editorial Hero Section (`homepage-hero-section`)**:\n  - **Headline**: *\"Little Things. Beautiful Moments.\"*\n  - **Supporting Copy**: *\"Thoughtfully chosen gifts and pretty essentials for moments worth celebrating.\"*\n  - **Primary CTA**: *\"Shop Gift Hampers\"* (navigates to Gift Hampers collection).\n  - **Secondary CTA**: *\"Explore Accessories\"* (navigates to Hair Accessories collection).\n  - **Visual Showcase**: Displays real, in-stock Pretty Charm products from the SQLite database (*Rose Gold Pearl Hair Claw*, *Rose Gold Pearl Drop Huggies*, and *Mulberry Silk Scrunchie Trio*) with their live INR prices.\n- **D. Shop by Category (`homepage-categories-section`)**:\n  - Editorial cards for **Gift Hampers**, **Hair Accessories**, **Jewellery**, **Cosmetics & Beauty \342\200\224 Coming Soon**, and **Festive Collection \342\200\224 Coming Soon**.\n  - Coming Soon categories are explicitly labelled `Coming Soon \302\267 Non-purchasable` and cannot be added to the bag.\n- **E. Featured Products (`homepage-featured-section`)**:\n  - Driven by `getHomepageFeaturedProducts()` using only `status === \'active\'` and `availableQty > 0` database records.\n  - Each card shows the genuine product image, actual product name, live stock count, variant summary, current selling price in `\342\202\271` (INR), Wishlist toggle, **View Product**, and **Add to Cart**. No fake discounts, strikethrough prices, or fabricated reviews are shown.\n- **F. Gift Hampers Collection (`homepage-hampers-section`)**:\n  - Dedicated section showcasing the 4 saved gift hampers (*Pretty Charm Celebration Box*, *Pretty Charm Premium Box*, *Pretty Charm Bestie Box*, and *Pretty Charm Mini Hamper*) with a **View All Hampers** link.\n  - Honestly displays their `Saved Draft \302\267 Awaiting Confirmation` status and proposed INR prices until activated in the Admin Panel.\n- **G. Brand Story (`homepage-brand-story`)**:\n  - Compact editorial section highlighting Pretty Charm\342\200\231s focus on thoughtful gifting and everyday accessories without fabricated company history or claims.\n- **H. Why Shop With Us (`homepage-why-shop-section`)**:\n  - 4 verified, Admin-configurable store commitments: *Thoughtfully selected products*, *Secure ordering process*, *Shipping information* (dynamically reflecting configured INR tiers), and *Customer support*.\n- **I. Instagram Section (`homepage-instagram-section`)**:\n  - **Follow Pretty Charm** card linking directly to the Admin-configured Instagram profile (`@prettycharm.in`) without a fake live feed or fabricated follower metrics.\n- **J. Newsletter & Offers (`homepage-newsletter-section`)**:\n  - Clearly labelled as `Newsletter & Offers \302\267 Disabled in Development` until a mailing service is configured.\n- **K. Footer (`site-footer`)**:\n  - Working links to **About Us**, **Contact**, **FAQ**, **Track My Order**, **Shipping Policy**, **Returns and Refunds**, **Privacy Policy**, **Terms and Conditions**, **Instagram**, and **WhatsApp Support**.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Files Changed\n\n- `/src/components/PremiumHomepage.tsx` \342\200\224 Created modular editorial homepage component implementing Sections C through J.\n- `/src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Integrated `<PremiumHomepage />`, updated the Announcement Bar (Section A), responsive Header & Mobile Navigation Drawer (Section B), and Footer (Section K), and set the default storefront entry view to `\'home\'`.\n- `/src/shared/domainLogic.ts` \342\200\224 Added `getHomepageFeaturedProducts`, `getHomepageGiftHampers`, `getVerifiedWhyShopBenefits`, and `buildInstagramProfileUrl`.\n- `/src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts` \342\200\224 Added unit test suite #14 verifying homepage featured product filtering, gift hamper filtering, verified store benefits, and Instagram URL sanitization.\n- `/src/components/AdminDashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Added Admin configuration field for `announcementBanner` under **14. Store Settings**.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification & Tests Passed\n\n- **Unit Tests (`npx --yes tsx --test src/shared/domainLogic.test.ts`)**: All **14 / 14** test suites passed.\n- **TypeScript & Production Build (`lint_applet` & `compile_applet`)**: Passed with zero TypeScript or bundle errors.\n- **Responsive & Interactive Browser Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n  - Verified zero horizontal overflow (`scrollWidth <= clientWidth`) across `360px`, `375px`, `390px`, `430px`, `768px`, and `1440px` viewports.\n  - Verified all 6 active in-stock products render genuine local photographs (`/uploads/products/*.jpg`) with `naturalWidth > 0`.\n  - Verified interactive flows: **Shop Gift Hampers** CTA, **Explore Accessories** CTA, **Add to Cart** on Featured Products (updating header & mobile bag counters), **View Product** navigation, mobile menu drawer toggle, and Footer policy navigation.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Honest Status of Images & Features\n\n- **Active In-Stock Products (6/6)**: All 6 active products have verified Wikimedia Commons CC-BY / CC-BY-SA product photographs stored locally in `/public/uploads/products/`.\n- **Draft Gift Hampers (4 items)**: *Pretty Charm Celebration Box*, *Premium Box*, *Bestie Box*, and *Mini Hamper* remain in `draft` status (`0` stock) awaiting owner box-contents confirmation and original studio photography, so they display their studio illustrations and are non-purchasable (`View Saved Details`).\n- **Newsletter Signup**: Explicitly disabled and labelled as a development placeholder until an email provider is configured."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile View**\n\nI\'ve just examined the `.playwright-cli/r2-mobile-360.png` file, specifically the rendering at a 360px width. The most notable observation is the clean wrapping of the announcement bar onto two centered lines. The text, specifically the shipping information, flows nicely within this constrained space, indicating a responsive design.\n\n\n**Observing UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the mobile view. The focus is now on individual UI elements. The hamburger menu, icons (account, wishlist, bag, and admin), and search bar are all rendering beautifully, with ample padding and no overflow, and the search functionality is working. The hero section and product components also stack cleanly, and all the journeys seem seamless, indicated by the clean exit codes, and absence of console errors.\n\n\n"
