  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Code Implementation**\n\nI\'m now diving into `/src/shared/domainLogic.ts` and its test file to flesh out the WhatsApp order and payment workflow. The goal is to keep all existing tests green and add a new one, Test #15, which will be the litmus test to verify the changes. I\'m focusing on the implementation details now.\n\n\n**Extending Enums and Logic**\n\nI\'m expanding the enums for `OrderStatus`, `PaymentStatus`, and `PaymentMode` to accommodate the new WhatsApp workflow states and payment options. My immediate focus is on ensuring these changes are backward-compatible with existing types. I\'m also updating the logic functions, specifically `canReleaseReservationOnCancel` and `getInitialPaymentStatusForMode`, to handle the new states gracefully. Adding `getInitialOrderStatusForMode` too.\n\n\n**Implementing Payment Validation**\n\nI\'m now implementing the payment validation and reporting logic. I\'m ensuring proper handling of bank references, considering both mandatory and optional scenarios based on payment modes, and the admin-confirmed state. I\'m also updating `calculateFinancialReport` to accurately reflect the \'paid\', \'refunded\', \'cancelled\', \'shipped\', and \'delivered\' states. Finally, I\'m integrating the Whatsapp message helpers into the logic as well.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_499629"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Extend OrderStatus, PaymentStatus, PaymentMode, and add WhatsApp-assisted order & payment workflow helpers in domainLogic.ts\", \"EndLine\":42, \"Instruction\":\"Add lowercase status variants and whatsapp payment mode to OrderStatus, PaymentStatus, and PaymentMode\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export type OrderStatus =\\n  | \'awaiting_payment\'\\n  | \'confirmed\'\\n  | \'processing\'\\n  | \'packed\'\\n  | \'shipped\'\\n  | \'delivered\'\\n  | \'cancelled\'\\n  | \'Pending Confirmation\'\\n  | \'Confirmed\'\\n  | \'Processing\'\\n  | \'Packed\'\\n  | \'Shipped\'\\n  | \'Delivered\'\\n  | \'Cancelled\'\\n  | \'Return Requested\'\\n  | \'Returned\'\\n  | \'Refunded\';\\n\\nexport type PaymentStatus =\\n  | \'pending\'\\n  | \'paid\'\\n  | \'failed\'\\n  | \'refunded\'\\n  | \'Demo Mode - Not Paid\'\\n  | \'Pending\'\\n  | \'Awaiting Verification\'\\n  | \'Paid\'\\n  | \'Failed\'\\n  | \'Refunded\';\\n\\nexport type ShipmentStatus =\\n  | \'Not Shipped\'\\n  | \'AWB Assigned\'\\n  | \'Picked Up\'\\n  | \'In Transit\'\\n  | \'Out for Delivery\'\\n  | \'Delivered\'\\n  | \'RTO / Returned\';\\n\\nexport type PaymentMode = \'whatsapp\' | \'demo\' | \'manual\' | \'razorpay\';\", \"StartLine\":11, \"TargetContent\":\"export type OrderStatus =\\n  | \'Pending Confirmation\'\\n  | \'Confirmed\'\\n  | \'Processing\'\\n  | \'Packed\'\\n  | \'Shipped\'\\n  | \'Delivered\'\\n  | \'Cancelled\'\\n  | \'Return Requested\'\\n  | \'Returned\'\\n  | \'Refunded\';\\n\\nexport type PaymentStatus =\\n  | \'Demo Mode - Not Paid\'\\n  | \'Pending\'\\n  | \'Awaiting Verification\'\\n  | \'Paid\'\\n  | \'Failed\'\\n  | \'Refunded\';\\n\\nexport type ShipmentStatus =\\n  | \'Not Shipped\'\\n  | \'AWB Assigned\'\\n  | \'Picked Up\'\\n  | \'In Transit\'\\n  | \'Out for Delivery\'\\n  | \'Delivered\'\\n  | \'RTO / Returned\';\\n\\nexport type PaymentMode = \'demo\' | \'manual\' | \'razorpay\';\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/shared/domain