      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Update .env.example with WhatsApp-assisted payment workflow configuration variables and warnings\", \"EndLine\":49, \"Instruction\":\"Update PAYMENT_MODE default and add PAYMENT_MANUAL_LINK and PAYMENT_MANUAL_QR_URL in .env.example\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"# PAYMENT CONFIGURATION:\\n# Allowed values: \\\"whatsapp\\\" | \\\"manual\\\" | \\\"razorpay\\\" | \\\"demo\\\"\\n# WARNING: Do not assume a personal or minor savings/UPI account is approved for commercial/merchant use.\\n# Confirm merchant account eligibility with your bank/payment provider before accepting live payments.\\nPAYMENT_MODE=\\\"whatsapp\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_UPI_ID=\\\"placeholder-upi@bank\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_LINK=\\\"\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_QR_URL=\\\"\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_ACCOUNT_NOTE=\\\"Owner verification in actual bank/UPI statement required before marking paid.\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_KEY_ID=\\\"\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=\\\"\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=\\\"\\\"\\n\\n# SHIPPING & COURIER (SHIPROCKET) CONFIGURATION:\\n# Automatic courier sync remains disabled until real credentials are supplied.\\nSHIPROCKET_ENABLED=\\\"false\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_EMAIL=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_PASSWORD=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_CITY=\\\"Gurugram\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_STATE=\\\"Haryana\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_PINCODE=\\\"122001\\\"\\n\\n# WHATSAPP & INSTAGRAM SUPPORT CONFIGURATION:\\n# Click-to-Chat (wa.me) opens WhatsApp with a prefilled message for manual sending.\\n# Automatic outbound messages require an official WhatsApp Business Platform/API and approved templates.\\nSTORE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=\\\"919000000000\\\"\\nSTORE_SUPPORT_EMAIL=\\\"support-placeholder@prettycharm.in\\\"\\nSTORE_INSTAGRAM_HANDLE=\\\"prettycharm.in\\\"\\n\", \"StartLine\":25, \"TargetContent\":\"# PAYMENT CONFIGURATION:\\n# Allowed values: \\\"demo\\\" | \\\"manual\\\" | \\\"razorpay\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MODE=\\\"demo\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_UPI_ID=\\\"placeholder-upi@bank\\\"\\nPAYMENT_MANUAL_ACCOUNT_NOTE=\\\"Owner verification required before marking Paid.\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_KEY_ID=\\\"\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=\\\"\\\"\\nRAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=\\\"\\\"\\n\\n# SHIPPING & COURIER (SHIPROCKET) CONFIGURATION:\\n# Automatic courier sync remains disabled until real credentials are supplied.\\nSHIPROCKET_ENABLED=\\\"false\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_EMAIL=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_PASSWORD=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPROCKET_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=\\\"\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_CITY=\\\"Gurugram\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_STATE=\\\"Haryana\\\"\\nSHIPPING_ORIGIN_PINCODE=\\\"122001\\\"\\n\\n# WHATSAPP & INSTAGRAM SUPPORT CONFIGURATION:\\n# Placeholder support number for Click-to-Chat links until business owner confirms official number.\\nSTORE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=\\\"919000000000\\\"\\nSTORE_SUPPORT_EMAIL=\\\"support-placeholder@prettycharm.in\\\"\\nSTORE_INSTAGRAM_HANDLE=\\\"prettycharm.in\\\"\", \"TargetFile\":\"/.env.example\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating .env.example\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update .env.example with WhatsApp order & payment configuration\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\331\003\n\326\003\001i\024}\023\357\006Hd\nw/H\004;G\270\\RM\017CC\237\337\341\2356\003$opda\001\027QPg\3273\023\220n\250X\n\a\345\301\023\027\271\240\251\237\177\030#\0067\016b\005\323\334y$\231\274\f1\002l\373\263\344^\337\002\377\315\233\317j$\'Mb\277\234G<H\251\337\361\203\236R%Li\277\344\003_\301\204\233\001\341\261\326Pq\t\177CH\025\357/m\f\a\202\311\367@\226Q=\212}\334\372\273\362\020\215,$>\324\027A\370\v\361\374t\321\2517\336\272Wg\327a\312\367\201\345\t[|-\033Tti\367\217\350\251\2629\274\3334\276\034nX\030\334#\312\003\250\003\v\220|\210\245\343\337CN\0230\003\231\326\224w\205tD\305\016?\267\255\330H\322\307\337\347_\2722<\213z\0058\203F\340\365Yo\357\322\371G\0009\306\255g\f\347g\026J\240d=\321\355\213\366\006\304\004\254a\353O\365.41\270/\243]\276@Ta\221\313\251\230\251\006=\234\351\234\036Y<\006\354\212\234qe\t\225y\256\241\334\006^\003\2745\313\3370p\335~\024\231g\b\373\037\'1\001\377\004leq[!\250\377\000\f\267\372\372+Q\256~\206YW\f\350\223\247\231<M\251\336\253#\245\330\320\334d\302\353G\000\r=\341\002\224\277m}\210s\033/\221Y\322&\353_\363(R\021,\002\036\207\220\200\t\207i\306\002\246\241G \220\353\005\r\177\312JW\345~n=/\342:?.\327\201\265\317\3128<6i\223\316\t\020/OW\0371:\271i2\350k\210d%\332\247K\375lp\226C\346\205\224\251\323M\003\350/\370S\351\360\246\224\227\335="
