            lines {
              text: "     - `order_status = \'awaiting_payment\'`"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **\"Order via WhatsApp\" Click-to-Chat Handoff**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The order confirmation screen provides an **\"Order via WhatsApp\"** button that opens `https://wa.me/<storePhone>?text=...` with a URL-encoded personalized message containing the Order ID, product names, variants, quantities, item prices, total amount, customer name, mobile number, and full delivery address."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The UI explicitly instructs the customer: **\"Important: Please press Send in WhatsApp\"** and never claims that opening WhatsApp automatically submits the message."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Saved Order Recovery**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - If the customer closes WhatsApp or returns to the website without sending the message, their saved order remains accessible directly in **My Bag**, **Checkout**, **Saved Orders**, and **Track My Order** (`POST /api/orders/track`) so they can re-open WhatsApp anytime without re-entering their address or creating duplicate orders."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Admin Workflow (`Admin Login` -> Tab `6. Orders`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Server-Side Authentication & Authorization**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Protected by HTTP-only session cookies and `requireAdmin` middleware."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Initial setup uses `/api/auth/bootstrap-admin` (when zero admin users exist), or signs in via `/api/auth/login`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Order Management, Search & Filtering**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - View all orders with Order ID, itemized products, customer details, delivery address, total amount, created timestamp, **Payment Status** (`pending` / `paid`), and **Fulfilment Status** (`awaiting_payment` / `confirmed` / `processing` / `packed` / `shipped` / `delivered`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Filter orders by search query (Order ID, customer name, phone, product), Payment Status, and Fulfilment Status."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Customer Contact & Payment Instructions via WhatsApp**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Copy Customer WhatsApp Link**: Copies `https://wa.me/91<customerMobile>` to clipboard."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Send Payment Instructions / Link / QR via WhatsApp**: Opens a prefilled WhatsApp Click-to-Chat message to the customer containing the Order ID, exact payable amount, and configured UPI ID / Payment Link / QR Image URL."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Bank-Checked Payment Verification & Audit Trail**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Clicking **\"Mark Payment Received (Bank Checked)\"** (`POST /api/admin/orders/:id/verify-payment`) updates `payment_status` to `\'paid\'` while keeping `order_status` separate (`awaiting_payment` until confirmed)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Records `verified_by_admin_id`, `verified_by_admin_email`, and `verified_at` on the order and writes an immutable `PAYMENT_VERIFIED` entry to the Audit Log."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Order Confirmation & Prefilled WhatsApp Confirmation**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Once payment is verified (`payment_status === \'paid\'`), the admin can click **\"Confirm Order\"** (`POST /api/admin/orders/:id/confirm`), which sets `order_status = \'confirmed\'` and logs `ORDER_CONFIRMED` in the Audit Log."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Clicking **\"Send Confirmation via WhatsApp\"** opens the customer\'s WhatsApp chat with a ready-to-send confirmation message containing the Order ID, items, total paid, and confirmed status."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Payment Safety & Compliance Rules"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **No Fake Payment Verification**: Orders are never marked paid automatically from screenshots, unverified UTR text, WhatsApp messages, or client-side URL parameters. Payment status changes to `paid` only when an authenticated Admin verifies the actual bank/UPI statement or verified payment gateway webhook."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Separate Payment & Fulfilment Statuses**: `payment_status` (`pending`, `paid`, `failed`, `refunded`) and `order_status` (`awaiting_payment`, `confirmed`, `processing`, `packed`, `shipped`, `delivered`, `cancelled`) are tracked independently."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Merchant / Commercial UPI Eligibility Warning**: Personal or minor savings/UPI accounts must **not** be assumed approved for merchant or commercial business collections. Before accepting customer payments via UPI ID, QR code, or payment links, verify merchant/business account eligibility and commercial compliance with your bank or RBI-regulated payment aggregator."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Click-to-Chat vs Official WhatsApp Business Platform API**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - `https://wa.me/...` Click-to-Chat links only open WhatsApp with prefilled text; the user or admin must manually press **Send** inside WhatsApp."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Fully automated background outbound WhatsApp messages require a separately provisioned official **Meta WhatsApp Business Platform (Cloud API)** account, verified business phone number ID, permanent access token, and pre-approved Meta message templates."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
          }
        }
        absolute_uri: "file:///README.md"
      }
    }
    use_fast_apply: true
    description: "Update README.md with complete documentation for the WhatsApp-assisted order and payment workflow, admin verification & confirmation steps, payment safety rules, and deployment setup"
    diff_stats {
      additions: 78
      deletions: 67
    }
  }
}
