  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Browser Behavior**\n\nI\'ve just initiated an end-to-end browser verification using `playwright-cli` within `run_command`. My immediate focus is on ensuring the storefront loads correctly at `http://localhost:3000` without any console or page errors. Additionally, I\'m specifically checking that the Gift Hampers priced at \342\202\271299 and \342\202\271499 are indeed active and available, as expected.\n\n\n**Validating Order Flow**\n\nI\'m now diving into the complete order process. My focus is to ensure a customer can add a \342\202\271299 hamper, go to checkout, enter details, and successfully click \"Order via WhatsApp\". I\'m specifically confirming the order saves correctly in SQLite with the \'pending\' payment status, and that the order success screen accurately displays the order ID and the WhatsApp link. I am also validating the customer\'s navigation following the order submission.\n\n\n**Analyzing Admin Interactions**\n\nI\'m now focused on the admin workflow, specifically validating order management. I\'ve logged in as admin and am checking order visibility with all details and states as they appear in the database. I am verifying the search and filter controls. Then I will validate links for WhatsApp actions, and confirm payment marking and order confirmation features. Finally, I will conduct mobile responsiveness checks.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_446602"
