  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Pin Code Validation**\n\nI\'ve been looking at the `validateCheckoutAddress` function within `src/shared/domainLogic.ts`. It seems the `checkPinCodeServiceability` function is overly restrictive. It\'s only accepting exact 6-digit pincodes present in `configuredPins`. That is causing rejections for otherwise valid Indian PIN codes, such as `400050`, which ought to be accepted.\n\n\n"
