      full: "### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.locator(\'input[name=\\\'pincode\\\']\').fill(\'400001\');```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\'place-order-submit-btn\\\']\').click();```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/- Page Title: Pretty Charm \342\200\223 Gift Hampers, Jewellery & Hair Accessories- Console: 1 errors, 0 warnings### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-10-24T13-59-30-060Z.yml)### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](.playwright-cli/order-whatsapp-handoff.png)### Ran Playwright code```js// Screenshot viewport and save it as .playwright-cli/order-whatsapp-handoff.pngawait page.screenshot({  path: \'.playwright-cli/order-whatsapp-handoff.png\',  scale: \'css\',  type: \'png\'});```### Result{  \"orderNumber\": \"PC-2026-1001\",  \"orderStatus\": \"awaiting_payment\",  \"paymentStatus\": \"pending\",  \"href\": \"https://wa.me/919000000000?text=Hello%20Pretty%20Charm!%20I%20would%20like%20to%20place%20my%20saved%20order%3A%0A%0AOrd\",  \"noticeText\": \"Action Required: Please Press \342\200\234Send\342\200\235 in WhatsAppYour order PC-2026-1001 is saved on our website, but opening WhatsApp does not automatically send your message. \",  \"previewText\": \"Hello Pretty Charm! I would like to place my saved order:\\n\\nOrder ID: PC-2026-1001\\nItems:\\n1. Pretty Charm Mini Hamper \342\200\224 Qty: 1 \303\227 \342\202\271299 = \342\202\271299\\n2. Pretty Charm Premium Box \342\200\224 Qty: 1 \303\227 \342\202\271499 = \342\202\271499\\n\\nSubtotal: \342\202\271798\\nShipping: \342\202\27139\\nTotal Amount: \342\202\271837\\n\\nCustomer Details:\\nName: Aarohi Sharma\\nPhone: +91 9876543210\\nDelivery Address: Flat 402, Roseate Residency, Bandra West, Carter Road, Mumbai, Haryana - 400001\\nDelivery Instructions: Please include a birthday ribbon\\n\\nPlease share the payment link or QR details for Order PC-2026-1001.\"}### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.evaluate(\'() => {\\n  const btn = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"order-via-whatsapp-btn\"]\\\');\\n  const notice = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"whatsapp-press-send-notice\"]\\\');\\n  const preview = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"whatsapp-order-message-preview\"]\\\');\\n  const orderNum = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"confirmed-order-number\"]\\\');\\n  const orderStatus = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"confirmed-order-status\"]\\\');\\n  const paymentStatus = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"confirmed-payment-status\"]\\\');\\n  if (!btn || !notice || !preview) throw new Error(\\\'Missing WhatsApp handoff elements\\\');\\n  return {\\n    orderNumber: orderNum?.textContent?.trim(),\\n    orderStatus: orderStatus?.textContent?.trim(),\\n    paymentStatus: paymentStatus?.textContent?.trim(),\\n    href: btn.getAttribute(\\\'href\\\')?.slice(0, 120),\\n    noticeText: notice.textContent.trim().slice(0, 160),\\n    previewText: preview.textContent.trim()\\n  };\\n}\');```"
