m%20order%20is%20now%20CONFIRMED.%0A%0AOrder%20ID%3A%20PC-2026-1001%0AConfirmation%20Status%3A%20Confirmed%20(Payment%20Verified)%0AOrder%20Items%3A%0A1.%20Pretty%20Charm%20Mini%20Hamper%20%C3%97%201%20%E2%80%94%20%E2%82%B9299%0A2.%20Pretty%20Charm%20Premium%20Box%20%C3%97%201%20%E2%80%94%20%E2%82%B9499%0ATotal%20Paid%3A%20%E2%82%B9837%0ADelivery%20Address%3A%20Flat%20402%2C%20Roseate%20Residency%2C%20Bandra%20West%2C%20Carter%20Road%2C%20Mumbai%2C%20Haryana%20-%20400001%0A%0AWe%20are%20preparing%20your%20order%20for%20dispatch%20from%20Gurugram%20and%20will%20share%20your%20courier%20AWB%20tracking%20details%20once%20shipped.%20Thank%20you%20for%20shopping%20with%20Pretty%20Charm!\",  \"cardTextSnippet\": \"PC-2026-1001\\nPayment: paid\\nFulfilment: confirmed\\n\\nCreated: 24/10/2026, 1:59:28 pm\\n\\nTotal: \342\202\271837\\n\\nSubtotal: \342\202\271798 \302\267 Shipping: \342\202\27139\\n\\nCustomer & Delivery Address\\n\\nName: Aarohi Sharma \302\267 Phone: +91 9876543210\\n\\nAddress: Flat 402, Roseate Residency, Bandra West, Carter Road, Mumbai, Haryana, 400001\\n\\nDelivery Instructions: Please include a birthday ribbon\\n\\nCopy Customer WhatsApp Link\\nSend Payment Instructions / Link / QR via WhatsApp\\n\\nOrdered Products (2)\\n\\nPretty Charm Mini Hamper \303\227 1\\n\342\202\271299\\nPretty Charm Premium Box \303\227 1\\n\342\202\271499\\n\\nStep 1: Verify Bank / UPI Payment\\n\\nCurrent Payment Status: paid\\n\\nPayment Verified\"}### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.evaluate(\'async () => {\\n  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 800));\\n  const payBadge = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"admin-order-payment-badge-PC-2026-1001\"]\\\');\\n  const statusBadge = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"admin-order-status-badge-PC-2026-1001\"]\\\');\\n  const sendConfWa = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"send-confirmation-wa-PC-2026-1001\"]\\\');\\n  const card = document.querySelector(\\\'[data-testid=\"admin-order-card-PC-2026-1001\"]\\\');\\n  return {\\n    paymentBadgeAfterConfirm: payBadge?.textContent?.trim(),\\n    statusBadgeAfterConfirm: statusBadge?.textContent?.trim(),\\n    sendConfirmationHref: sendConfWa?.getAttribute(\\\'href\\\'),\\n    cardTextSnippet: card?.innerText?.slice(0, 600)\\n  };\\n}\');```### Result- [Screenshot of viewport](.playwright-cli/admin-orders-verified.png)### Ran Playwright code```js// Screenshot viewport and save it as .playwright-cli/admin-orders-verified.pngawait page.screenshot({  path: \'.playwright-cli/admin-orders-verified.png\',  scale: \'css\',  type: \'png\'});```Browser \'default\' closed"
