  planner_response {
    response: "The **Pretty Charm** e-commerce platform has been updated with a complete, server-validated **WhatsApp-assisted order and payment workflow**.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Customer Order & WhatsApp Handoff Flow**\n  - **Active Gift Hampers (\342\202\271299 & \342\202\271499)**: Enabled the \342\202\271299 (`Pretty Charm Mini Hamper`, `Pretty Charm Bestie Box`) and \342\202\271499 (`Pretty Charm Premium Box`, `Pretty Charm Celebration Box`) gift hampers alongside hair accessories and jewellery.\n  - **Server-Side Checkout Validation & Persistence**: Before opening WhatsApp, `POST /api/checkout` validates product status, database prices, stock availability, and delivery address fields on the server, creating a unique Order ID (e.g., `PC-2026-1001`) in SQLite with initial `payment_status = \'pending\'` and `order_status = \'awaiting_payment\'`.\n  - **\"Order via WhatsApp\" Click-to-Chat**: Provides an **Order via WhatsApp** button that opens a URL-encoded `https://wa.me/<businessPhone>?text=...` message containing the Order ID, itemized products, variants, quantities, unit prices, total amount, customer name, phone number, complete delivery address, and optional delivery instructions.\n  - **Explicit Send Instruction & Saved Order Recovery**: Clearly instructs customers to press **Send** inside WhatsApp (never claiming that opening WhatsApp automatically submits the order) and persists saved orders on the website (**Shopping Bag**, **Checkout**, and **Track My Order**) so returning customers can resume their order anytime.\n\n- **Admin Order, Payment Verification & Confirmation Workflow**\n  - **Server-Side RBAC Protection**: Protected by authenticated Admin sessions and `requireAdmin` authorization.\n  - **Search & Filter Orders**: Filter orders by Order ID, customer name, phone number, product name, Payment Status (`pending`, `paid`, `failed`, `refunded`), and Fulfilment Status (`awaiting_payment`, `confirmed`, `processing`, `packed`, `shipped`, `delivered`, `cancelled`).\n  - **Customer Contact & Payment Instructions**: Admins can copy the customer\'s WhatsApp link (`https://wa.me/91<mobile>`) and open a prefilled WhatsApp message containing payment instructions, Merchant UPI ID, payment link, or QR image URL.\n  - **Bank-Checked Payment Verification & Audit Trail**: Clicking **Mark Payment Received (Bank Checked)** updates `payment_status` to `paid` (keeping it separate from `order_status`), records the verifying admin\'s ID, email, bank/UPI reference, and timestamp, and writes an immutable `PAYMENT_VERIFIED` audit log entry.\n  - **Order Confirmation via WhatsApp**: Once payment is verified (`paid`), admins can click **Confirm Order** (`order_status = \'confirmed\'`, logged as `ORDER_CONFIRMED`) and use **Send Confirmation via WhatsApp** to open the customer\'s chat with a ready-to-send confirmation message.\n\n- **Payment Safety & Mobile Optimization**\n  - Enforces strict separation between payment status and fulfilment status, blocks fake/automatic payment verification from screenshots or unverified UTR text, and displays a clear warning regarding commercial/merchant UPI account eligibility vs. personal/minor accounts.\n  - Verified responsive layouts across `360px`, `375px`, `390px`, and `430px` mobile viewports with zero horizontal overflow."
    modified_response: "The **Pretty Charm** e-commerce platform has been updated with a complete, server-validated **WhatsApp-assisted order and payment workflow**.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Customer Order & WhatsApp Handoff Flow**\n  - **Active Gift Hampers (\342\202\271299 & \342\202\271499)**: Enabled the \342\202\271299 (`Pretty Charm Mini Hamper`, `Pretty Charm Bestie Box`) and \342\202\271499 (`Pretty Charm Premium Box`, `Pretty Charm Celebration Box`) gift hampers alongside hair accessories and jewellery.\n  - **Server-Side Checkout Validation & Persistence**: Before opening WhatsApp, `POST /api/checkout` validates product status, database prices, stock availability, and delivery address fields on the server, creating a unique Order ID (e.g., `PC-2026-1001`) in SQLite with initial `payment_status = \'pending\'` and `order_status = \'awaiting_payment\'`.\n  - **\"Order via WhatsApp\" Click-to-Chat**: Provides an **Order via WhatsApp** button that opens a URL-encoded `https://wa.me/<businessPhone>?text=...` message containing the Order ID, itemized products, variants, quantities, unit prices, total amount, customer name, phone number, complete delivery address, and optional delivery instructions.\n  - **Explicit Send Instruction & Saved Order Recovery**: Clearly instructs customers to press **Send** inside WhatsApp (never claiming that opening WhatsApp automatically submits the order) and persists saved orders on the website (**Shopping Bag**, **Checkout**, and **Track My Order**) so returning customers can resume their order anytime.\n\n- **Admin Order, Payment Verification & Confirmation Workflow**\n  - **Server-Side RBAC Protection**: Protected by authenticated Admin sessions and `requireAdmin` authorization.\n  - **Search & Filter Orders**: Filter orders by Order ID, customer name, phone number, product name, Payment Status (`pending`, `paid`, `failed`, `refunded`), and Fulfilment Status (`awaiting_payment`, `confirmed`, `processing`, `packed`, `shipped`, `delivered`, `cancelled`).\n  - **Customer Contact & Payment Instructions**: Admins can copy the customer\'s WhatsApp link (`https://wa.me/91<mobile>`) and open a prefilled WhatsApp message containing payment instructions, Merchant UPI ID, payment link, or QR image URL.\n  - **Bank-Checked Payment Verification & Audit Trail**: Clicking **Mark Payment Received (Bank Checked)** updates `payment_status` to `paid` (keeping it separate from `order_status`), records the verifying admin\'s ID, email, bank/UPI reference, and timestamp, and writes an immutable `PAYMENT_VERIFIED` audit log entry.\n  - **Order Confirmation via WhatsApp**: Once payment is verified (`paid`), admins can click **Confirm Order** (`order_status = \'confirmed\'`, logged as `ORDER_CONFIRMED`) and use **Send Confirmation via WhatsApp** to open the customer\'s chat with a ready-to-send confirmation message.\n\n- **Payment Safety & Mobile Optimization**\n  - Enforces strict separation between payment status and fulfilment status, blocks fake/automatic payment verification from screenshots or unverified UTR text, and displays a clear warning regarding commercial/merchant UPI account eligibility vs. personal/minor accounts.\n  - Verified responsive layouts across `360px`, `375px`, `390px`, and `430px` mobile viewports with zero horizontal overflow."
